e and neck. Can be used alone or before your moisturiser.</p>\r\n<p>For dehydrated skin, add 1-2 drops of Serum-Infused Night Oil to your Skin Inc serums or Pure Deepsea Hydrating Mask to create a nourishing gel cream/emulsion.</p>\r\n<p>Please consume by 31-03-2023</p>','uploads/products/photos/SI-001-20-X-.1.jpg',NULL,'serum-infused-night-oil-20ml---without-packaging-si-001-20-x',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-12 07:29:06','2020-11-13 16:50:50',0),(236,'Pure Revival Peel (Beauty on the go) - WITHOUT PACKAGING','seller',20,1,1,2,4,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/PS-005-20-X-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/PS-005-20-X-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p><span style=\"color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Buff, polish and glow &mdash; all in one non-abrasive peel without scrubbing or stress to the skin. Sloughs away dullness causing dead skin and impurities and preps the skin for maximum absorption of skincare treatments that follow. Acts as a dynamic primer to create the perfect canvas for your makeup. Pure Revival Peel combines high-performance ingredients AC-11, Arbutin and Fullerene to visibly but gently remove old keratin and impurities, revealing bright, renewed skin.</span></p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif;\">Use dry hands to apply a thin layer of Pure Revival Peel to clean, dry skin after cleansing. Leave on for approximately 10 seconds, then gently massage in a circular motion. Dead keratin will be formed into particles, showing the exfoliating effect. Gentle enough to be used on lip and eye area.</p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit; margin-top: 0px; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.6em; color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif;\">Rinse off with warm water. Use 2-3 times a week.</p>\n<p style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizin