-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Triple-layer serum-infused H2Oil technology combines serum, cleansing water and oil to effectively remove make-up and impurities while treating the skin in one fuss-free step. Tough on makeup but gentle on skin, this cleansing oil leaves skin soft and glowin\' with no oily residue.</p>\n<p>Shake the bottle to mix the 3 layers. Apply 3 to 4 pumps to dry palms and gently massage onto dry face in a circular motion. Add lukewarm water to emulsify. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</p>\n<p>Expiry: March 2021</p>',78.00,1.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'PS-017-150',1,60.00,'percent',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'PURE TRINITY SERUM-INFUSED CLEANSING OIL 150ML','<p>Triple-layer serum-infused H2Oil technology combines serum, cleansing water and oil to effectively remove make-up and impurities while treating the skin in one fuss-free step. Tough on makeup but gentle on skin, this cleansing oil leaves skin soft and glowin\' with no oily residue.</p>\r\n<p>Shake the bottle to mix the 3 layers. Apply 3 to 4 pumps to dry palms and gently massage onto dry face in a circular motion. Add lukewarm water to emulsify. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.</p>\r\n<p>Please consume by 31/3/21</p>','uploads/products/photos/PS-017-150-.1.jpg',NULL,'pure-trinity-serum-infused-cleansing-oil-150ml-ps-017-150',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-12 10:00:10','2020-11-12 18:20:22',0),(238,'Night Regime Kit','seller',20,1,1,2,4,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/BS-109-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/BS-109-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>A luxurious serum and oil in one, designed to work double time on your skin while you sleep. The cutting-edge technology features a powerhouse of antioxidants and a host of lipophilic and hydrophilic ingredients in a dual-layer form.</p>\n<p>The Sculpt Lift Bar 24K Gold has multiple benefits for inner and outer beauty for glowing skin and a youthful appearance. The pulsating massage is also relaxing and de-stressing. For busy urbanites like us, this handy tool is a real timesaver in our increasingly hectic lifestyles.</p>\n<p>- Detox your skin through lymphatic drainage and reduce water retention to achieve the V-sculpt and lifted-look</p>\n<p>- Improve blood circulation</p>\n<p>- Tone and contour face</p>\n<p>- Alleviate puffiness under eyes and face by mimicking a good facial massage</p>\n<p>face and neck. Can be used alone or before your moisturiser.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Additional Tips:</p>\n<p>For dehydrated skin, add 1-2 drops of Serum-Infused Night Oil to your Skin Inc serums or Pure Deepsea Hydrating Mask to create a nourishing gel cream/emulsion.</p>\n<p>Sculpt LIft Bar 24K Gold</p>\n<p>Massage with 24K gold sculpt lift bar making long motions upward on forehead and chin or jawline to v-lift. Gently massage undereyes to have a de-puffing effect. Pair it with your favorite skincare products for an optimal result.</p>\n<p>- Battery-operated, 1 pc LR6 AA 1.5V required; Battery included</p>\n<p>Expiry: February 2022</p>',118.00,1.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'BS-109',1,50.00,'percent',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,5,'Night Regime Kit','<p>A luxurious serum and oil in one, designed to work double time on your skin while you sleep. The cutting-edge technology features a powerhouse of antioxidants and a host of lipophilic and hydrophilic ingredients in a dual-layer form.</p>\r\n<p>The Sculpt Lift Bar 24K Gold has multiple benefits for inner and outer beauty for glowing skin and a youthful appearance. The pulsating massage is also relaxing and de-stressing. For busy urbanites like us, this handy tool is a real timesaver in our increasingly hectic lifestyles.</p>\r\n<p>- Detox your skin through lymphatic drainage and reduce water retention to achieve the V-sculpt and lifted-look</p>\r\n<p>- Improve blood circulation</p>\r\n<p>- Tone and contour face</p>\r\n<p>- Alleviate puffiness under eyes and face by mimicking a good facial massage</p>\r\n<p>face and neck. Can be used alone or before your moisturiser.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Additional Tips:</p>\r\n<p>For dehydrated skin, add 1-2 drops of Serum-Infused Night Oil to your Skin Inc serums or Pure Deepsea Hydrating Mask to create a nourishing gel cream/emulsion.</p>\r\n<p>Sculpt LIft Bar 24K Gold</p>\r\n<p>Massage with 24K gold sculpt lift bar making long motions upward on forehead and chin or jawline to v-lift. Gently massage undereyes to have a de-puffing effect. Pair it with your favorite skincare products for an optimal result.</p>\r\n<p>- Battery-operated, 1 pc LR6 AA 1.5V required; Battery included</p>\r\n<p>Please consume by 28/2/22</p>','uploads/products/photos/BS-109-.1.jpg',NULL,'night-regime-kit-bs-109',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-12 10:01:08','2020-11-16 14:29:53',0),(239,'Dewy On-The-Go Set','seller',20,1,1,2,4,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/BS-120-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/BS-120-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Skin Inc\'s favourite beauty-on-the-go set for glowy and dewy skin!</p>\n<p>20ML Pure Revival Peel: A non-abrasive peel that visibly but gently sloughs away dead surface skin, revealing bright, renewed skin.</p>\n<p>10ML Hylauronic Acid: Give your skin a tall glass of replenishing and intense hydration with Hyaluronic Acid Serum for a softer, smoother and younger-looking skin. This hydration booster can be used individually but it is designed to mix (or blend)) with two other Skin Inc serums to tackle multiple skin concerns and to provide your \'one size fits me\' customized skin serum cocktail.</p>\n<p>20ML Pure Deepsea Hydrating Overnight Mask: A unique sleep-in transparent gel mask that hydrates, clarifies, and brightens skin, all in a single step&mdash;for use every night as a luxurious daily treatment.</p>\n<p>Comes with Limited Edition Clear Travel Pouch<br /><br />Expiry: March 2022</p>',132.00,1.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'BS-120',1,60.00,'percent',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,2,'Dewy On-The-Go Set','<p>Skin Inc\'s favourite beauty-on-the-go 