f the dead skin cells to reveal fresher smoother looking skin.</p>\r\n<p>Expiry: March 2022</p>','uploads/products/photos/BS-110-.1.jpg',NULL,'maskaholic-set-bs-110',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-11-12 16:03:06','2020-12-01 13:12:36',0),(250,'SKIN-REVIVAL INFUSION SERUM 30ML - GLOBAL','seller',20,1,1,2,4,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/ES-010-30-2-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/ES-010-30-2-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p><span style=\"color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Supercharge your skin\'s renewal. Packed with Uttwiler Sp&auml;tlauber Stem Cell extract, an ultra-rare Swiss apple species, botanicals and deeply hydrating Hyaluronic Acid, this concentrated serum addresses all major signs of aging. It plumps lines, lifts and firms sagging skin, amplifies the effectiveness of other skincare products, and activates optimal cell renewal.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Apply two to three drops twice daily to face and undereye before moisturizer or eye cream.</span><br style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit; color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\" /><br style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit; color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\" /><strong style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit; color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Additional Tips<br style=\"-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; box-sizing: inherit;\" /></strong><span style=\"color: #5e5b5b; font-family: Futura, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Powerful booster to use alone or mixed with other Skin Inc serums or moisturisers for a amped up anti-aging effect.</span></p>',218.00,1.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,99,'ES-010-30-2',1,40.00,'percent',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'SKIN-REVIVAL INFUSION SERUM 30ML - GLOBAL','<p><span style=\"color: #5e5b5b; font-fam