INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (965,'Estée Lauder Nutritious Vitality 8 Radiant Energy Moisture Crème 50ML','seller',203,1,8,NULL,55,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1332144-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1332144-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Estée Lauder Nutritious Vitality 8 Radiant Energy Moisture Crème 50ML</p><p></p><p>Suitable for all skin types</p><p></p><p>Intense, 24-hour hydration. Precision-crafted super-pomegranate complex, now with 2X pomegranate concentrate. Helps protect skin with anti-oxidant power. Gently detoxifies skin while infusing it with moisture for super-hydrated, plumped, glowing skin.The Nutritious Super-Pomegranate CollectionPure Essence of Mediterranean PomegranateHarvested from the pristine Mediterranean basin, our pomegranates are transformed through an 8-step whole-fruit cold-solvent extraction process to preserve power and potency.Precision-Crafted Blend of 8 Potent IngredientsOur masterfully crafted complex is infused with the pure essence of Mediterranean pomegranate, plus a patented Super-Berry ferment, essential vitamins and minerals.Created for and tested on Asian women in Asia.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>',116.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1332144',1,52.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,2,'Estée Lauder Nutritious Vitality 8 Radiant Energy Moisture Crème 50ML','<p>Estée Lauder Nutritious Vitality 8 Radiant Energy Moisture Crème 50ML</p><p></p><p>Suitable for all skin types</p><p></p><p>Intense, 24-hour hydration. Precision-crafted super-pomegranate complex, now with 2X pomegranate concentrate. Helps protect skin with anti-oxidant power. Gently detoxifies skin while infusing it with moisture for super-hydrated, plumped, glowing skin.The Nutritious Super-Pomegranate CollectionPure Essence of Mediterranean PomegranateHarvested from the pristine Mediterranean basin, our pomegranates are transformed through an 8-step whole-fruit cold-solvent extraction process to preserve power and potency.Precision-Crafted Blend of 8 Potent IngredientsOur masterfully crafted complex is infused with the pure essence of Mediterranean pomegranate, plus a patented Super-Berry ferment, essential vitamins and minerals.Created for and tested on Asian women in Asia.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>','uploads/products/photos/1332144-.1.jpg',NULL,'est-e-lauder-nutritious-vitality-8-radiant-energy-moisture-cr-me-50ml-1332144',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:03','2020-12-11 17:11:42',0),(966,'Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 100ML','seller',203,1,70,NULL,152,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1332955-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1332955-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p>Scent: Fruity-fresh</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>',133.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1332955',1,73.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 100ML','<p>Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p>Scent: Fruity-fresh</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>','uploads/products/photos/1332955-.1.jpg',NULL,'juicy-couture-oui-eau-de-parfum-100ml-1332955',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:03','2020-12-10 17:20:01',0),(967,'Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 50ML','seller',203,1,70,NULL,152,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1332956-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1332956-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 50ML</p><p>Scent: Fruity-fresh</p><p></p><p>Get hooked right from the start with the tart freshness from a fusion of Watermelon and Lemon in a special Water Lemon note. The chic sophistication of Jasmine Absolute paired with provocative Wild Tuberose creates an iconic duo while a modern sense of addiction is born through sleek Techno Woods. Just say OUI to an addictive energy and movement that doesn’t stop.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>',104.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1332956',1,57.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 50ML','<p>Juicy Couture OUI Eau de Parfum 50ML</p><p>Scent: Fruity-fresh</p><p></p><p>Get hooked right from the start with the tart freshness from a fusion of Watermelon and Lemon in a special Water Lemon note. The chic sophistication of Jasmine Absolute paired with provocative Wild Tuberose creates an iconic duo while a modern sense of addiction is born through sleek Techno Woods. Just say OUI to an addictive energy and movement that doesn’t stop.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>','uploads/products/photos/1332956-.1.jpg',NULL,'juicy-couture-oui-eau-de-parfum-50ml-1332956',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:03','2020-12-10 17:20:06',0),(968,'Dior Ultra Rouge Lipstick N° 770 Ultra Love','seller',203,1,71,NULL,106,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1333309-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1333309-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Dior Ultra Rouge Lipstick N° 770 Ultra Love</p><p></p><p>Rouge Dior Ultra Rouge is the first incredibly long-wearing lipstick with the comfort of a lip ink*: a true revolution in the history of lipstick. Ultra Rouge offers a lightweight, ultra-comfortable formula and all the colours of a high-pigmentation lipstick. The colours seem more saturated with a luminous, semi-matte finish** for incredible sensoriality and hydration. * At Dior. ** Instrumental test carried out on 20 subjects. Except shade 000.</p><p></p><p>Made in France</p>',48.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1333309',1,22.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,3,'Dior Ultra Rouge Lipstick N° 770 Ultra Love','<p>Dior Ultra Rouge Lipstick N° 770 Ultra Love</p><p></p><p>Rouge Dior Ultra Rouge is the first incredibly long-wearing lipstick with the comfort of a lip ink*: a true revolution in the history of lipstick. Ultra Rouge offers a lightweight, ultra-comfortable formula and all the colours of a high-pigmentation lipstick. The colours seem more saturated with a luminous, semi-matte finish** for incredible sensoriality and hydration. * At Dior. ** Instrumental test carried out on 20 subjects. Except shade 000.</p><p></p><p>Made in France</p>','uploads/products/photos/1333309-.1.jpg',NULL,'dior-ultra-rouge-lipstick-n-770-ultra-love-1333309',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:03','2020-12-14 18:11:28',0),(969,'Michael Kors Wonderlust Eau So Fresh Eau de Parfum 100ML','seller',203,1,70,NULL,114,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1334866-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1334866-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Michael Kors Wonderlust Eau So Fresh Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p>Scent: Fresh</p><p></p><p>Made in Switzerland</p>',96.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1334866',1,29.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'Michael Kors Wonderlust Eau So Fresh Eau de Parfum 100ML','<p>Michael Kors Wonderlust Eau So Fresh Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p>Scent: Fresh</p><p></p><p>Made in Switzerland</p>','uploads/products/photos/1334866-.1.jpg',NULL,'michael-kors-wonderlust-eau-so-fresh-eau-de-parfum-100ml-1334866',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:03','2020-12-13 09:40:15',0),(970,'Miu Miu Fleur d\'Argent Eau de Parfum 100ML','seller',203,1,70,NULL,66,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1336404-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1336404-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Miu Miu Fleur d\'Argent Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p></p><p>The new Miu Miu Fleur d’Argent Eau de Parfum Absolue is all about preciousness and elegance: the Miu Miu fragrance family grows by exploring a more feminine and sensual facet of the Miu Miu girl - introducing a more mature white flower : Tuberose.</p><p></p><p>Made in France</p>',200.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'1336404',1,130.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,4,'Miu Miu Fleur d\'Argent Eau de Parfum 100ML','<p>Miu Miu Fleur d\'Argent Eau de Parfum 100ML</p><p></p><p>The new Miu Miu Fleur d’Argent Eau de Parfum Absolue is all about preciousness and elegance: the Miu Miu fragrance family grows by exploring a more feminine and sensual facet of the Miu Miu girl - introducing a more mature white flower : Tuberose.</p><p></p><p>Made in France</p>','uploads/products/photos