 padded pocket. It can be carried using the two leather covered handles or the detachable and adjustable branded nylon shoulder strap. The back of the Document Case also features a satellite system to attach the bag to a trolley\'s handles. The bag comes with a leather-covered luggage tag with transparent view.</p><p></p><p>38 X 7 X 28 cm</p><p></p><p>Made in Italy</p>',1019.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,0,'1258843',1,455.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'Montblanc Sartorial Office Bag','<p>Montblanc Sartorial Office Bag </p><p></p><p>The Montblanc Sartorial Jet collection combines clean elegance and lightness, thanks to a combination of black Saffiano-print calf leather and plain water- and scratch-resistant black nylon fabric with a satin finish. The Document Case Slim is equipped with a front zipped pocket and a single main compartment with zip closure. The internal organisation of the bag consists of a zipped pocket, 2 open pockets for mobile phones and 3 writing instruments loops. The bag can also accommodate a laptop in the open padded pocket. It can be carried using the two leather covered handles or the detachable and adjustable branded nylon shoulder strap. The back of the Document Case also features a satellite system to attach the bag to a trolley\'s handles. The bag comes with a leather-covered luggage tag with transparent view.</p><p></p><p>38 X 7 X 28 cm</p><p></p><p>Made in Italy</p>','uploads/products/photos/1258843-.1.jpg',NULL,'montblanc-sartorial-office-bag-1258843',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-04 07:14:06','2020-12-14 17:32:05',0),(1054,'Montblanc Extreme 2.0 Wallet','seller',203,13,83,NULL,154,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/1384355-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/1384355-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Montblanc Extreme 2.0 Wallet</p><p></p><p>With its bold black colour, plain leather inside and leather with carbon-fibre print motif outside, the wallet is the perfect companion for young urban explorers to keep their credi