asy-to-use, plant-based omega-3 liquid.</p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>Suggested use by body weight 5-10 lb: 0.5 mL, 11-20 lb: 1.0 mL, 21-25 lb: 1.5 mL, 26-35 lb: 2.0 mL, For babies 6 months or older or as directed by your pediatrician. For best results, please refrigerate and use within three months after opening.</p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>EPA: 250 mg, DHA: 520 mg, Other Omega-3s: 65 mg, Total Omega-3s: 835 mg. marine algae oil (Schizochytrium sp.), high-oleic sunflower oil, natural mixed tocopherols, rosemary extract (a natural perservative), sunflower lecithin, ascorbyl palmitate. No gluten, milk derivative, or artificial colors or flavours. 100% hexane free.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p><p></p><p>Expiry  (6/21)</p></p>','uploads/products/photos/1670-.1.jpg',NULL,'nordic-naturals-baby-s-dha-vegetarian-30ml---expiry-11-21-1670',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 10:00:29','2021-04-01 09:41:32',0),(1185,'Nordic Naturals Vita C Gummies 60s','seller',195,2,15,NULL,145,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/30160-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/30160-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/30160-.3.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/30160-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Nordic Naturals Vitamin C Gummies offers an essential nutrient that kids need for growth and development.</p><p></p><p>In addition to supporting many of the body\'s physiological functions, vitamin C helps optimize immunity and provides antioxidant protection.</p><p></p><p>These delicious, sour, tangerine-flavored gummy slices are suitable for children ages 4+. Grown-ups love them, too!</p><p></p><p>For ages 4+</p><p>250 mg vitamin C per serving</p><p>No artificial coloring, flavoring, or preservatives</p><p>Pectin based and gelatin free</p><p>100% vegetarian</p><p>Supports a healthy immune system</p><p>Provides antioxidant support</p><p>Recommendation</p><p>For 4 years and older, two gummies daily with food, or as directed by your health care professional or pharmac