erry Extract, Rhubarb Extract, Aloe Extract, Fennel Extract. Also contains Magnesium Stearate, Silica, Vege Capsule</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Made in New Zealand</p>',98.20,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,49,'40857',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount',NULL,0.00,0.00,1,'Greenlife Synbiotic Slim','<p><p>(1) Product Description</p><p>GreenLife® Synbiotic Slim is an innovative product targeting digestive health and weight management. This product contains a unique combination of probiotics and prebiotics to nourish your microbiome (the unique blend of bacteria or flora we have living inside us) these healthy bacterial strains are more strongly linked to a healthy weight.</p><p></p><p>Blended with Raspberry Ketones for metabolic effects and digestive herbs for regularity and elimination. This comprehensive formulation targets – healthy digestion, healthy gut bacteria, healthy immunity, weight management and nutrient absorption. It also offers key support to the body during times of stress, bloating and flatulence.</p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>Take one capsule a day and combine with a healthy diet and exercise plan for natural weight control.</p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>Probiotic Blend 25 Billion CFU (Lactobacillus gasseri, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus plantarum), Prebiotic Blend 260mq (Sunfiber (Partially Hydrolyzed Guar Gum), Fructooligosaccharides (FOS). Digesten, Kiwifruit Prebiotic Extract. Digestive Aid & Enzyme Blend -- Raspberry Ketones, Acai berry Extract, Rhubarb Extract, Aloe Extract, Fennel Extract. Also contains Magnesium Stearate, Silica, Vege Capsule </p><p></p><p>Made in New Zealand</p><p></p><p>Expiry  (3/21)</p></p>','uploads/products/photos/40857-.1.jpg',NULL,'Greenlife-Synbiotic-Slim-40857',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 10:00:30','2021-04-01 09:43:18',0),(1189,'Greenlife Coconut Oil 454g - Expiry 10/21','seller',195,2,16,NULL,144,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/31623-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/pho