garine, shortening or other cooking oils for baking or frying in temperatures up to 350 F. No refrigeration necessary</p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>Total Fat 14 g (Saturated Fat 13 g, Polyunsaturated Fat <0.5 g, Monounsaturated Fat <1 g), Medium Chain Fatty Acids 9 g (8,694 mg) (Lauric Acid 7 g (6,657 mg), Caprylic Acid 1 g (1,043 mg), Capric Acid 900 mg), other ingredients: Organic Extra Virgin Coconut Oil</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p><p></p><p>Expiry (10/21)</p></p>','uploads/products/photos/31623-.1.jpg',NULL,'greenlife-coconut-oil-454g---expiry-10-21-31623',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 10:00:30','2021-04-01 09:40:09',0),(1190,'GreenLife White Floral 30 capsules - Expiry 10/21','seller',195,2,16,NULL,144,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/46907-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/46907-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/46907-.3.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/46907-.4.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/46907-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>(1) Product Description</p>\n<p>GreenLife Whitefloral contains IBR-TCLC, an unique ingredient derived from special non-GMO white tomato plants.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This exceptional plant is a rich source of colourless carotenoids, phytoene and phytofluene, which are precursor molecules in the carotenoid metabolic pathway.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>These extremely stable antioxidants specifically absorb UV wavelength light to lighten and brighten the skin.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>GreenLife Whitefloral has been researched to support the body in times of ageing, wrinkles, dryness, pigmentation and redness as well as excess exposure to UV wavelengths of light.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p>\n<p>Take 1 capsule per day or as directed by a healthcare professional.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(3) Ingredients</p>\n<p>IBR-TCLC&reg; (min. 1% Phytoene and Phytofluene), L-Cysteine HCl, Grapeseed Extract (Providing Anthocyanins), AstaMAZ&reg; (natural Astaxanthin), Vitamin C (from Ascorbic 