 cartilage and connective tissue function.  The combination of three key ingredients, Glucosamine, Chondroitin Sulphate and MSM (Methyl Sulfonyl Methane) promotes joint health. It absorbs quickly and penetrates deeply into the muscle and joints improving movement and flexibility.  GreenLife uses the purest form of Glucosamine powder mixed with high levels of Chondroitin Sulphate and MSM.  1xJoint & Muscle Cream (125g)</P><P></P><P>Made in New Zealand</P>',47.50,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,1,10,'40253',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'GreenLife Joint & Muscle Cream (125g)','<p><p>(1) Product Description</p><p>GreenLife Joint and Muscle Cream has been formulated to provide support for healthy joint, cartilage and connective tissue function.</p><p></p><p>The combination of three key ingredients, Glucosamine, Chondroitin Sulphate and MSM (Methyl Sulfonyl Methane) promotes joint health. It absorbs quickly and penetrates deeply into the muscle and joints improving movement and flexibility.</p><p></p><p>GreenLife uses the purest form of Glucosamine powder mixed with high levels of Chondroitin Sulphate and MSM.</p><p></p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>Apply liberally to the affected area until the cream is absorbed. Wash hands after use. Use 1-2 times daily.</p><p></p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>Active Ingredients:</p><p>Glucosamine HCL, 10% w/w, Chondroitin Sulphate, MSM (Methylsulfonylmethane), Curcuma Zedoaria Root Oil (Essential), Cinnamon Zeylanicum Oil, Zingiber Officinale Root Oil, Menthol.</p><p></p><p>Inactive Ingredients:</p><p>Water - Purified, Beeswax, Glycerol Mono Stearate, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis Oil, Capric Caprylic Triglycerides, Cetearyl Octanoate, Glycerine, Sorbitan, Oleate, Diisopropyl Adipate, Dioctyl Malate, Phenoxyethanol and Caprylyl Glycine.</p><p></p><p>Made in New Zealand</p><p></p><p>Expiry 10/21) </p></p>','uploads/products/photos/40253-.1.jpg',NULL,'greenlife-joint-muscle-cream-125g--40253',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 10:00:30','2021-04-01 09:43:31',0),(1192,'Shaklee Chewable Cal Mag Plus 120 tablets','seller',195,2,16,NULL,146,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/21216-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/21216-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>(1) Product Description</p>\n<p>Calcium, magnesium, vitamin D, and more</p>\n<p>Promotes bone health</p>\n<p>Optimizes peak bone mass</p>\n<p>Helps maintain bone density and slows bone breakdown</p>\n<p>Shaklee Chewable Cal Mag Plus contains a unique combination of nutrients and trace elements such as 600 IU of Vitamin D3 and 1,000 mg of calcium.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Adequate calcium and vitamin D throughout life, as part of a well-balanced diet and regular exercise, may reduce the risk of osteoporosis^.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>^ Regular exercise and a healthy diet with supplemental calcium may reduce the risk of osteoporosis, especially in the elderly. Adequate calcium intake is important, but daily intake above 2,000 mg is not likely to provide any additional benefits.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p>\n<p>The recommended serving of Chewable Cal Mag Plus is 4 tablets daily for adults, or 2 tablets daily for children ages 4 to 12, preferably taken with food.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(Adequate calcium consumption is critical, but daily intakes above 2,000 mg are not likely to provide any additional benefit.)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(3) Ingredients</p>\n<p>Vitamin D3 600 IU / Calcium 1,000mg / Magnesium 100mg / Zinc 1.5mg / Copper 0.2mg / Manganese 0.2mg</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Made in USA</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',43.50,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'21216',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'Shaklee Chewable Cal Mag Plus 120 tablets','<p><p>(1) Product Description</p><p>Calcium, magnesium, vitamin D, and more</p><p>Promotes bone health</p><p>Optimizes peak bone mass</p><p>Helps maintain bone density and slows bone breakdown</p><p>Shaklee Chewable Cal Mag Plus contains a unique combination of nutrients and trace elements such as 600 IU of Vitamin D3 and 1,000 mg of calcium.</p><p></p><p>Adequate calcium and vitamin D throughout life, as part of a well-balanced diet and regular exercise, may reduce the risk of osteoporosis^.</p><p></p><p> </p><p></p><p>^ Regular exercise and a healthy diet with supplemental calcium may reduce the risk of osteoporosis, especially in the elderly. Adequate calcium intake is important, but daily intake above 2,000 mg is not likely to provide any additional benefits.</p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>The recommended serving of Chewable Cal Mag Plus is 4 tablets daily for adults, or 2 tablets daily for children ages 4 to 12, preferably taken with food.</p><p></p><p>(Adequate calcium consumption is critical, but daily intakes above 2,000 mg are not likely to provide any additional benefit.)</p><p></p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>Vitamin D3 600 IU / Calcium 1,000mg / Magnesium 100mg / Zinc 1.5mg / Copper 0.2mg / Manganese 0.2mg</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p><p></p><p>Expiry  (7/21)</p></p>','uploads/products/photos/21216-.1.jpg',NULL,'shaklee-chewable-cal-mag-plus-120-tablets-21216',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 17:00:29','2021-04-01 09:43:45',0),(1193,'Shaklee Joint & Muscle Cream 855g','seller',195,2,16,NULL,146,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/31051-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/31051-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>(1) Product Description</p>\n<p>Pain relief that works in a hurry</p>\n<p>Shaklee Joint &amp; Muscle Pain Cream provides temporary relief in minutes. Deeply penetrating to target arthritis pain, backaches, sore muscle, sports injuries and more.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This non-greasy, menthol formula enables fast absorption and provides prolonged release action to affected areas. So effective and convenient to use - keep one for the medicine cabinet, purse, and gym bag.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p>\n<p>Adults and children over the age of 2. Apply generously to affected area. Massage well into painful area. Repeat as necessary, but not more often than 3 to 4 times daily.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For external use only. Do not use with a heating pad. Do not apply to wounds or damaged skin. Do not bandage tightly after use. Avoid contact with eyes.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Discontinue use and consult a physician if condition worsens, or if symptoms persist more than 7 days or clear up and occur again within a few days.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Keep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a poison control center right away.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(3) Ingredients</p>\n<p>Active Ingredient: Menthol. Inactive Ingredients Water, Butylene Glycol, Prunus amygdalus dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, PEG-12 Glyceryl Distearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Cyclomethicone, PEG-100 Stearate, Dimethicone, Aloe barbadensis Leaf Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Caprylyl Glycol, Hexylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Triethanolamine, Xanthan Gum.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Made in USA</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',56.70,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,50,'31051',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Shaklee Joint & Muscle Cream 855g','<p><p>(1) Product Description</p><p>Pain relief that works in a hurry</p><p>Shaklee Joint & Muscle Pain Cream provides temporary relief in minutes. Deeply penetrating to target arthritis pain, backaches, sore muscle, sports injuries and more.</p><p></p><p>This non-greasy, menthol formula enables fast absorption and provides prolonged release action to affected areas. So effective and convenient to use - keep one for the medicine cabinet, purse, and gym bag.</p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>Adults and children over the age of 2. Apply generously to affected area. Massage well into painful area. Repeat as necessary, but not more often than 3 to 4 times daily.</p><p></p><p>For external use only. Do not use with a heating pad. Do not apply to wounds or damaged skin. Do not bandage tightly after use. Avoid contact with eyes.</p><p></p><p>Discontinue use and consult a physician if condition worsens, or if symptoms persist more than 7 days or clear up and occur again within a few days.</p><p></p><p>Keep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a poison control center right away.</p><p></p><p></p><p>(3) Ingredients</p><p>Active Ingredient: Menthol. Inactive Ingredients Water, Butylene Glycol, Prunus amygdalus dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, PEG-12 Glyceryl Distearate, Cetyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Stearate, Cyclomethicone, PEG-100 Stearate, Dimethicone, Aloe barbadensis Leaf Extract, Ethylhexylglycerin, Carbomer, Caprylyl Glycol, Hexylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Triethanolamine, Xanthan Gum.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p><p></p><p>Expiry  (4/21)</p></p>','uploads/products/photos/31051-.1.jpg',NULL,'shaklee-joint-muscle-cream-855g-31051',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2020-12-05 17:00:29','2021-04-01 09:44:02',0),(1194,'Shaklee B-Complex 120 tablets','seller',195,2,16,NULL,146,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/13011-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/13011-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/13011-.3.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/13011-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>(1) Product Description</p>\n<p>High potency B vitamins with patented folic acid delivery system.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>B-Complex supports the body&rsquo;s performance:</p>\n<p>- Helps power brain, heart, lungs, and other organs</p>\n<p>- Promotes cellular energy production</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The B vitamins are vital for proper bodily function as they help convert food into energy for your cells.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>There are eight essential B vitamins, and they work best when they work together.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, the typical Western diet doesn&rsquo;t provide enough whole grains, leafy green vegetables, and fish needed to provide 100% of the Daily Value.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Patented bioactivated delivery system Dietary folate, a critical B vitamin, isn\'t easily absorbed, so Shaklee developed a unique folic acid coating that makes the nutrient more accessible to promote absorption.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This patented technology is a Shaklee exclusive.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Recommendations</p>\n<p>2 tablets daily.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Other ingredients:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p>\n<p>Take two tablets daily.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(3) Ingredients</p>\n<p>MICROCRYSTAWNE CELLULOSE, TORULA YEAST, QyF HYDROXYPROPYL ME11-1YLCELLULOSE, CROSCARMELLOSE SODIUM, HYDROXYLATED SOY LECITHIN</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Made in USA</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',41.50,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,49,'13011',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'Shaklee B-Complex 120 tablets','<p><p>(1) Product Description</p><p>High potency B vitamins with patented folic acid delivery system.</p><p></p><p>B-Complex supports the body’s performance:</p><p>- Helps power brain, heart, lungs, and other organs</p><p>- Promotes cellular energy production</p><p></p><p>The B vitamins are vital for proper bodily function as they help convert food into energy for your cells.</p><p></p><p>There are eight essential B vitamins, and they work best when they work together.</p><p></p><p>Unfortunately, the typical Western diet doesn’t provide enough whole grains, leafy green vegetables, and fish needed to provide 100% of the Daily Value.</p><p></p><p>Patented bioactivated delivery system Dietary folate, a critical B vitamin, isn\'t easily absorbed, so Shaklee developed a unique folic acid coating that makes the nutrient more accessible to promote absorption.</p><p></p><p>This patented technology is a Shaklee exclusive.</p><p></p><p>Recommendations</p><p>2 tablets daily.</p><p></p><p>Other ingredients: </p><p></p><p>(2) How to Use / Storage Instructions</p><p>Take two tablets daily.</p><p></p><p