-supported strains survive passage through the GI tract to provide reliable support for digestive wellness and immune health.</p><p></p><p></p><p>With 1.5 billion live cultures, Nordic Naturals Probiotic Gummies Kids is a synergistic formula that combines Bacillus coagulans, a potent probiotic, with prebiotic fiber.</p><p></p><p>Daily support for intestinal health</p><p>Aids in the absorption of nutrients</p><p>Helps boost protective immune system functions</p><p>No refrigeration needed</p><p>Allergen free, vegan, and non-GMO</p><p>No dairy, wheat, gluten, corn, or soy</p><p>Recommendation</p><p>Two capsules daily, with or before a meal, preferably in the morning, or as directed by your health care professional or pharmacist.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>','uploads/products/photos/01672-.1.jpg',NULL,'nordic-naturals-probiotic-daily-60s-01672',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-27 06:01:04','2021-04-01 09:49:23',0),(1424,'Nordic Naturals Baby\'s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder 30 pkts','seller',195,2,15,60,145,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01675-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01675-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01675-.3.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/01675-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Nordic Naturals Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder provides convenient digestive support for little ones with widely researched probiotic strains that are shown to be safe and effective for developing babies and young children.</p><p></p><p>4 billion CFU</p><p>Clinically shown to be safe for babies and young children (ages 6 months – 3 years)</p><p>No refrigeration needed</p><p>Unflavored, sugar-free probiotic powder</p><p>Allergen free</p><p>Non-GMO and vegan</p><p>Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder combines two safe and extensively studied probiotic strains—Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG and Bifidobacterium animalis ssp. lactis—to benefit babies’ and young children’s overall health and development.</p><p>Clinical research has shown that these strains work together to promote gastrointestinal health, help boost protective immune system functions, and help balance the gut microbiome.</p><p>Research also suggests these two strains may promote resistance to common infections and provide additional immune support for babies attending daycare.</p><p>For easy delivery, Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder comes in convenient 1.5 gram packets that can be mixed into room temperature liquids (breastmilk, formula, etc.) or soft foods. The odorless and tasteless powder makes it virtually undetectable and well-received by even the pickiest eaters.</p><p></p><p>Clinical research has shown that these strains work together to promote gastrointestinal health, help boost protective immune system functions, and help balance the gut microbiome.</p><p>Research also suggests these two strains may promote resistance to common infections and provide additional immune support for babies attending daycare.</p><p>For easy delivery, Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder comes in convenient 1.5 gram packets that can be mixed into room temperature liquids (breastmilk, formula, etc.) or soft foods. The odorless and tasteless powder makes it virtually undetectable and well-received by even the pickiest eaters.</p><p></p><p>Recommendation</p><p>For babies and toddlers (ages 6 months – 3 years), mix one probiotic packet with room temperature liquid (breast milk, formula, etc.) or soft food, once daily, or as directed by your pediatrician or health care professional..</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>',42.80,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,10,'01675',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Nordic Naturals Baby\'s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder 30 pkts','<p>Nordic Naturals Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder provides convenient digestive support for little ones with widely researched probiotic strains that are shown to be safe and effective for developing babies and young children.</p><p></p><p>4 billion CFU</p><p>Clinically shown to be safe for babies and young children (ages 6 months – 3 years)</p><p>No refrigeration needed</p><p>Unflavored, sugar-free probiotic powder</p><p>Allergen free</p><p>Non-GMO and vegan</p><p>Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder combines two safe and extensively studied probiotic strains—Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG and Bifidobacterium animalis ssp. lactis—to benefit babies’ and young children’s overall health and development.</p><p>Clinical research has shown that these strains work together to promote gastrointestinal health, help boost protective immune system functions, and help balance the gut microbiome.</p><p>Research also suggests these two strains may promote resistance to common infections and provide additional immune support for babies attending daycare.</p><p>For easy delivery, Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder comes in convenient 1.5 gram packets that can be mixed into room temperature liquids (breastmilk, formula, etc.) or soft foods. The odorless and tasteless powder makes it virtually undetectable and well-received by even the pickiest eaters.</p><p></p><p>Clinical research has shown that these strains work together to promote gastrointestinal health, help boost protective immune system functions, and help balance the gut microbiome.</p><p>Research also suggests these two strains may promote resistance to common infections and provide additional immune support for babies attending daycare.</p><p>For easy delivery, Baby’s Nordic Flora Probiotic Powder comes in convenient 1.5 gram packets that can be mixed into room temperature liquids (breastmilk, formula, etc.) or soft foods. The odorless and tasteless powder makes it virtually undetectable and well-received by even the pickiest eaters.</p><p></p><p>Recommendation</p><p>For babies and toddlers (ages 6 months – 3 years), mix one probiotic packet with room temperature liquid (breast milk, formula, etc.) or soft food, once daily, or as directed by your pediatrician or health care professional..</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>