ptimal benefit.</p><p></p><p>Promotes regularity</p><p>Helps alleviate gas and bloating</p><p>Broad-spectrum strains support gut biodiversity</p><p>No refrigeration needed</p><p>Allergen free, vegan, and non-GMO</p><p>No dairy, wheat, gluten, corn, or soy</p><p>Recommendation</p><p>One capsule daily, with or before a meal, preferably in the morning, or as directed by your health care professional or pharmacist.</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>','uploads/products/photos/01676-.1.jpg',NULL,'nordic-naturals-probiotic-comfort-30-s-01676',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-27 06:01:04','2021-04-01 09:49:00',0),(1426,'Nordic Naturals Nordic Flora Probiotic Woman 60\'s','seller',195,2,16,46,145,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01677-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01677-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01677-.3.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/01677-.4.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/01677-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Nordic Natural\'s Nordic Flora Probiotic Woman is the ideal probiotic to address the unique health needs of women of all ages.</p><p></p><p>It features a blend of six probiotic strains with 15 billion live cultures, including the probiotic powerhouse Lactobacillus acidophilus DDS-1®, plus prebiotic FOS.</p><p></p><p>These research-supported strains survive passage through the GI tract to provide optimal digestive support.</p><p></p><p>The addition of whole cranberry powder adds support for urinary tract health, while the 3:1 ratio of Lactobacilli to Bifidobacteria helps balance vaginal flora.</p><p></p><p>Helps balance vaginal flora</p><p>Supports urinary tract health</p><p>Supports digestive, immune, and intestinal health</p><p>No refrigeration needed</p><p>Allergen free, vegan, and non-GMO</p><p>No dairy, wheat, gluten, corn, or soy</p><p>Recommendation</p><p>Two capsules daily, with or before a meal, preferably in the morning, or as directed by your health care professional or pharmacist</p><p></p><p>Made in USA</p>',88.00,0.00,0,'[]','[