f wild Lingzhi. It is suitable for both female and male, and can be consumed over a long period of time. Vita Green Lingzhi can be taken as a general health tonic. Long term consumption can lead to good health. Ingredient: 100% Wild Lingzhi (Ganoderma Lucidum) (Each capsule contains natural Lingzhi raw herb amount of 3.78 gram) Recommended Usage: Take orally, 1-2 capsule(s) daily. Packaging: The net weight of each capsule is 380 mg, 72 capsules/ bottle Product details Scientifically shown to: 1. Strengthen Immune System 2. Promote Blood Circulation 3. Increase Vitality and Energy 4. Reduce Signs of Aging by Improving Complexion Natural &amp; Wild Lingzhi Lingzhi, also known as Ganoderma Lucidum, is a fungus renowned for its medicinal properties. Considered a rare and precious Chinese medicinal herb in nature, it is found wild only in the deepest part of remote mountain forests where the soil and humidity provide the perfect conditions. The old Chinese medical directory, Shen Nong&rsquo;s Medica, and the respected medical bible of Chinese medicine, The Chinese Herbal Materia Medica, both cited Lingzhi has high medicinal properties. Lingzhi was said to provide energy, help women gain a glowing complexion and help maintain health in elderly. Lingzhi, The Modern Medical Aspiration Modern studies backed findings of the Chinese Medica. Researchers found that Lingzhi contains high content of Germanium, Complex Polysaccharides, Polysaccharide Peptides and Triterpenoids. All of these substances are known to be beneficial for strengthening the immune system and restoring normal bodily functions. Vita Green Lingzhi Capsule There are distinctive qualities in Vita Green Lingzhi Capsules. People have long stressed the quality of harvesting Lingzhi in its natural habitat. However, Lingzhi is very selective of its environment and can only be found in the deepest part of untamed mountain forests. Wild Lingzhi is darker in color, stronger in aroma and harder than cultivated Lingzhi. Vita Green Lingzhi Capsules are made from 100% wild Lingzhi harvested in the natural forests of China. Vita Green Lingzhi has been working continuously with leading Hong Kong and Chinese Universities to conduct research into the benefits of Vita Green Lingzhi: 1.Strengthen Immune System 2.Promote Blood Circulation 3.Increase Vitality and Energy 4.Improve Complexion 5.Reduce Signs of Aging, e.g. Decreased Energy</span></p>',109.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'8891',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'Vita Green Lingzhi 72s','<p>Increases the body\'s antioxidant levels, strengthens the immune system, helps protect kidney cells and may posses anti-ageing properties such as increasing appetite and energy levels, reducing white hair and age spots, and aiding sleep.</p><p></p><p>Made in Hong Kong</p>','uploads/products/photos/8891-.1.jpg',NULL,'vita-green-lingzhi-72s-8891',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-01-29 05:01:02','2021-04-01 10:31:21',0),(1459,'Vita Green Yin Yang Cordyceps 60s','seller',195,2,16,70,147,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/8907-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/8907-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Extra Strength VITA YIN YANG™ Capsules is a gift for longevity and overall energy. It helps to tonify kidney yin and lung yin. It is extracted from premium grade cultivated Cordyceps Mycelia. It is also a superb remedial & nutritional aid to inefficient qi in kidney and lung.</p><p></p><p>Made in Hong Kong</p>',99.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,0,'8907',1,25.00,'percent',0.00,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Vita Green Yin Yang Cordyceps 60s','<p>Extra Strength VITA YIN YANG™ Capsules is a gift for longevity and overall energy. It helps to tonify kidney yin and lung yin. It is extracted from premium grade cultivated Cordyceps Mycelia. It is also a superb remedial & nutritional aid to inefficient qi in kidney and lung.</p><p></p><p>Made in Hong Kong</p>','uploads/products/photos/8907-.1.jpg',NULL,'vita-green-yin-yang-cordyceps-60s-8907',0,0.00