ing on the move.</p><p></p><p>Extensive Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0 makes it compatible with all Bluetooth devices. Monster S110 Speaker would automatically reconnect to the last device used. Insert a micro SD card straightly to convert into micro SD card mode.</p><p></p><p>Rugged & Durable: Featuring IPX5 water resistance protection, block against water splash, spray, and dust. Seamless mesh fabric material and rugged housing ensures speaker\'s durability for fearless entertainment. you can take your speaker to the courtyard or garden, or wherever you like.</p><p></p><p></P>','uploads/products/photos/850015401688-.1.jpg',NULL,'monster-s110-superstar-speaker-850015401688',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 13:04:20','2021-03-25 08:19:12',0),(1619,'MONSTER Persona ANC Headphone','seller',1540,15,94,100,228,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/850015401985-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/850015401985-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Monster Persona is designed and engineered by Noel Lee and Monster Design Team in USA. Pure Monster Sound is a proprietary audio signature that offers the full experience of live music. You have to hear it to believe it.</p><p></p><p>HIGHLIGHTS</p><p>Digital Active Noise Cancellation: Monster Persona enhances the noise reduction performance, you can enjoy a quieter environment and more focus on your work no matter you are in a plane cabin, city traffic or a busy office.</p><p>Clear Voice Call: Persona has built-in microphone for clear voice call.</p><p>Quick Charge And Long Battery Life: USB-C is now the most popular and updated connection to charge Monster Persona. It supports 5 minutes quick charge for 2.5 hours playtime. For 1 hour fully charge, you can use up to 30 hours via Bluetooth connection.</p><p>Comfortable And Adjustable: The highest quality materials and design are used – ultra-flexible headband, precision folding hinges, memory foam ear cushions, non-slip silicone head pad for durable style and function.</p><p>More Reliable Co