.1.jpg',NULL,'monster-mission-v1-850017611085',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-17 13:04:20','2021-03-25 08:19:13',0),(1621,'MONSTER M97 Superstar Microphone','seller',1540,15,94,103,228,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/850017611283-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/850017611283-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>MONSTER M97 karaoke microphone has 26W peak power (two full range 13W speakers inside), which can provide powerful stereo sound.</p><p></p><p>HIGHLIGHTS</p><p>Innovative All in One Design: MONSTER M97 karaoke microphone has 26W peak power (two full range 13W speakers inside), which can provide powerful stereo sound. The mic, speakers and premium IC module are all in the stylish mushroom head. M97 karaoke microphone also can be used as bluetooth speaker and recorder.</p><p>Bluetooth 5.0: Our karaoke microphone has Bluetooth 5.0 module which can ensure more stable and quick pairing. Compatible with most bluetooth devices like iPhone, iPad, Samsung, PC, tablet, laptop and most mobile music apps, you can enjoy karaoke party anywhere and anytime.</p><p>True Wireless Stereo: You can connect two M97 karaoke microphones together easily to play the same accompaniment and then you can sing the same song with your friends happily.</p><p>Special Sound Effects: There are 3 different sound effects in this karaoke microphone. LOLI sound (change into little girl), WALI sound (change into robot) and Monster sound, which can make singing more interesting and make the kids happy.</p><p>Easy Operation: Our karaoke microphone has one button for song vocal elimination, you can switch between vocal and accompaniment easily, which make you sing happier and more confident. Volume of microphone or accompaniment also can be tune easily with buttons. It is absolutely a wonderful gift for families, kids and friends.</p><p></P>',139.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,8,'850017611283',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'MONSTER M97 Superstar Microphone','<p>MONSTER M97 karaoke 