0,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,22,'FR-CDBBR',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'CHATEAU DE BELCIER AOC BORDEAUX ROUGE 2014','2014 Vintage: Black and red berry fruit on the nose, with peony and soft spices.\r\nGenerous in the mouth, luscious, with adequately present tannins. Lots of fruits\r\nand a fresh finale. Great character.','uploads/products/photos/FR-CDBBR-.1.jpg',NULL,'chateau-de-belcier-aoc-bordeaux-rouge-2014-fr-cdbbr',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 09:04:44','2021-04-10 06:24:29',0),(1665,'BOEKENHOUTSKLOOF THE CHOCOLATE BLOCK 2019','seller',1544,12,79,96,203,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/SA-BTCB-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/SA-BTCB-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Grapes: Syrah (71%) Grenache (11%) Cinsault (9%) Cabernet Sauvignon (8%) Viognier (1%)</p><p></p><p>Tasting note: </p><p></p><p>The nose is dark, intense and brooding with aromas of black cherries, cardamom, sweet tobacco, espresso and subtle whiffs of perfume. The dark fruit character of the nose follows through onto an exceptionally complex, juicy palate with gentle nuances of ripe plums, violets, black olives, cloves, and liquorice. The mid-palate is focused, lithe and elegant with very fine, cocoa powdery tannins. The wine is medium bodied, very balanced with an earthy, layered character, covering the entire spectrum of berry fruit - from tart red plums to rich blue and black berries. The finish is svelte, clean and dry, peppery and lingering, with hints of dried cranberry, tar, graphite and smoke.</p><p></p>',67.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,1,12,'SA-BTCB',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'BOEKENHOUTSKLOOF THE CHOCOLATE BLOCK 2019','Grapes: Syrah (71%) Grenache (11%) Cinsault (9%) Cabernet Sauvignon (8%) Viognier (1%)\r\n\r\nTasting note: \r\n\r\nThe nose is dark, intense and brooding with aromas of black cherries, cardamom, sweet tobacco, espresso and subtle whiffs of perfume. The dark fruit character of the nose follows through onto an exceptionally complex, juicy palate with gentle nuances of ripe plums, violets, black olives, cloves, and liquorice. The mid-palate is focused, lithe and elegant with very fine, cocoa powdery tannins. The wine is medium bodied, very balanced with an earthy, layered character, covering the entire spectrum of berry fruit - from tart red plums to rich blue and black berries. The finish is svelte, clean and dry, peppery and lingering, with hints of dried cranberry, tar, graphite and smoke.','uploads/products/photos/SA-BTCB-.1.jpg',NULL,'boekenhoutskloof-the-chocolate-block-2019-sa-btcb',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 09:04:44','2021-04-12 07:15:40',0),(1666,'FAMILIE HUGEL PINOT NOIRE \"HUGEL\"','seller',1544,12,79,97,215,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FR-FHPN-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/FR-FHPN-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: France</p>\n<p>Grape(s): Pinot Noir</p>\n<p>Tasting Notes:&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A lightly young and fresh colour with hints of claret red, ripe griotte cherry and ruby with a few purple highlights accompanied by a wonderful shimmer and transparency.</p>\n<p>Its aromatic and beautiful character is young, precise and clearly stated with a fruity pleasantness which lets the pinot noir grape stand out. Hints of red fruit, cranberry, redcurrant, griotte cherry, hawthorn blossom, rose, wood-flowers and a touch of blond tobacco leaf associated with a nice youthful freshness.</p>\n<p>On the palate this is an elegantly structured red wine with a long lasting flavour and pleasantly easy to drink, in spite of the slight smooth presence of tannins leading to a well-balanced and fruity after-taste.</p>',48.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,10,'FR-FHPN',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,1,'FAMILIE HUGEL PINOT NOIRE \"HUGEL\"','Country: France\r\n\r\nGrape(s): Pinot Noir\r\n\r\nTasting Notes: \r\n\r\nA lightly young and fresh colour with hints of claret red, ripe griotte cherry and ruby with a few purple highlights accompanied by a wonderful shimmer and transparency.\r\nIts aromatic and beautiful character is young, precise and clearly stated with a fruity pleasantness which lets the pinot noir grape stand out. Hints of red fruit, cranberry, redcurrant, griotte cherry, hawthorn blossom, rose, wood-flowers and a touch of blond tobacco leaf associated with a nice youthful freshness.\r\nOn the palate this is an elegantly structured red wine with a long lasting flavour and pleasantly easy to drink, in spite of the slight smooth presence of tannin leading to a well-balanced and fruity after-taste.','uploads/products/photos/FR-FHPN-.1.jpg',NULL,'familie-hugel-pinot-noire-hugel--fr-fhpn',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 09:04:44','2021-04-10 06:24:29',0),(1667,'JOSEPH DROUHIN LAFORET BOURGOGNE ROUGE','seller',1544,12,79,96,216,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FR-JDLB-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/FR-JDLB-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: France</p><p></p><p>\"A wine full of charm: bright ruby colour and a nose rich with aromas of red fruit (raspberry, red currants, wild strawberry). On the palate, the wine is pleasant, fruity and refreshing, with light tannins and great elegance.</p><p>Aperitif \"finger food\"? A light (almost) improvised dinner, lunch in a trendy restaurant, LaForêt is always in right place! Its a no brainer, LaForêt is at ease everywhere and with everything or almost! Pinot Noir and grilled chicken, pasta with pesto... simple things, a sign of times\"</p>',62.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,12,'FR-JDLB',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'JOSEPH DROUHIN LAFORET BOURGOGNE ROUGE','Country: France\r\n\r\n\"A wine full of charm: bright ruby colour and a nose rich with aromas of red fruit (raspberry, red currants, wild strawberry). On the palate, the wine is pleasant, fruity and refreshing, with light tannins and great elegance.\r\nAperitif \"finger food\"? A light (almost) improvised dinner, lunch in a trendy restaurant, LaForêt is always in right place! Its a no brainer, LaForêt is at ease everywhere and with everything or almost! Pinot Noir and grilled chicken, pasta with pesto... simple things, a sign of times\"','uploads/products/photos/FR-JDLB-.1.jpg',NULL,'joseph-drouhin-laforet-bourgogne-rouge-fr-jdlb',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 09:04:44','2021-04-09 05:33:35',0),(1668,'MOET & CHANDON ROSE IMPERIAL BRUT','seller',1544,12,79,99,32,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FR-MCC-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/FR-MCC-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: France</p><p></p><p>A champagne produced from a blend of 50% Pinot Noir, 29% Pinot Meunier and 21% Chardonnay grape varieties. The beverage undergoes an aging process of at least 3 years. Due to the small quantity of sugar (less than 1.5%) the champagne is dry and classic, with rich and delicate flavors and a flowery and fruity aroma.</p>',69.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,12,'FR-MCC',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'MOET & CHANDON ROSE IMPERIAL BRUT','Country: France\r\n\r\nA champagne produced from a blend of 50% Pinot Noir, 29% Pinot Meunier and 21% Chardonnay grape varieties. The beverage undergoes an aging process of at least 3 years. Due to the small quantity of sugar (less than 1.5%) the champagne is dry and classic, with rich and delicate flavors and a flowery and fruity aroma.','uploads/products/photos/FR-MCC-.1.jpg',NULL,'moet-chandon-rose-imperial-brut-fr-mcc',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 09:04:44','2021-04-09 05:33:53',0),(1669,'RUINART BLANC DE BLANC CHAMPAGNE NV','seller',1544,12,79,99,221,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FR-RBDB-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/FR-RBDB-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: France</p><p></p><p>Super curated reduction here, heading into slightly meaty territory with grapefruit, toasted lemon peel and hazelnuts. The palate is delivered in a smooth, sweet-fruited style with approachable peach flesh. Drink now.</p>',119.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,12,'FR-RBDB',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount'