se ruby red, with a warm and intense ripe nose, whilst on the palate it is complex, smooth and full bodied, with clear shades of dried grapes.</p>',90.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,1,24,'IT-TADVC',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'TOMMASI AMARONE DELLA VALPOLICELLA CLASSICO DOCG 2016','Country: Italy\r\nProduced from the three Valpolicella grape varieties of Corvina Veronese, Rondinella and Molinara, cultivated high on the hillside terraces. After harvest the grapes are placed directly onto small open racks and brought to the open sided building where they are dried by the cool breezes of autumn and winter until the following February. The wine then undergoes a period of aging of at least four years in oak barrels before bottling. The colour is an intense ruby red, with a warm and intense ripe nose, whilst on the palate it is complex, smooth and full bodied, with clear shades of dried grapes.','uploads/products/photos/IT-TADVC-.1.jpg',NULL,'tommasi-amarone-della-valpolicella-classico-docg-2016-it-tadvc',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:34','2021-04-12 07:15:50',0),(1691,'VALDITERRA GAVI DOCG 2017','seller',1544,12,79,97,226,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/IT-VG-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/IT-VG-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Italy&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Grape Varietal: Cortese</p>\n<p>Tasting Note: Integral old factory profile with floral, citrus, and mineral notes. Its expressive purity is striking throughout the gustatory timeframe: tasty energy, typical sharp freshness, balanced until its lengthy finale.</p>',39.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,1,24,'IT-VG',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'VALDITERRA GAVI DOCG 2017','Country: Italy\r\n\r\nGrape Varietal: Cortese \r\n\r\nTasting Note: Integral olfactory profile with floral, citrus and mineral notes. Its expressive purity is striking throughout the gustatory timeframe: tasty energy, typical sharp freshness, balanced until its lengthy finale.','uploads/products/photos/IT-VG-.1.jpg',NULL,'valditerra-gavi-docg-2017-it-vg',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:34','2021-04-12 07:16:48',0),(1692,'TENUTA IMPOSTINO VIANDANTE SANGIVOSES RISERVA 2009','seller',1544,12,79,96,223,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/IT-TIVSR-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/IT-TIVSR-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Italy</p><p></p><p>The colour red ruby with garnet, has a rich and intense aroma, with hints of fruit, enhanced by notes of sweet spices and wood.</p><p></p><p>The taste is full-bodied, well-structured, soft tannins and fresh with a dense texture.</p>',59.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,12,'IT-TIVSR',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'TENUTA IMPOSTINO VIANDANTE SANGIVOSES RISERVA 2009','Country: Italy\r\n\r\nThe colour red ruby with garnet, has a rich and intense aroma, with hints of fruit, enhanced by notes of sweet spices and wood.\r\n\r\nThe taste is full-bodied, well-structured, soft tannins and fresh with a dense texture.','uploads/products/photos/IT-TIVSR-.1.jpg',NULL,'tenuta-impostino-viandante-sangivoses-riserva-2009-it-tivsr',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:34','2021-04-09 05:39:05',0),(1693,'SAN MARZANO TALO PRIMITIVO MERLOT 2018','seller',1544,12,79,96,222,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/IT-SMTPM-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/IT-SMTPM-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Italy</p><p></p><p>Grapes Varietals: Primitivo, Merlot</p><p></p><p>Tasting Notes: </p><p></p><p>Deep ruby red. Rich bouquet of ripe red fruit, cherries, soft fruits and some cinnamon notes. A wine with a remarkable structure enriched by a velvety tannic texture and a long endnote with a pleasant aftertaste.</p>',55.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,60,'IT-SMTPM',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'SAN MARZANO TALO PRIMITIVO MERLOT 2018','Country: Italy\r\n\r\nGrapes Varietals: Primitivo, Merlot\r\n\r\nTasting Notes: \r\n\r\nDeep ruby red. Rich bouquet of ripe red fruit, cherries, soft fruits and some cinnamon notes. A wine with a remarkable structure enriched by a velvety tannic texture and a long endnote with a pleasant aftertaste.','uploads/products/photos/IT-SMTPM-.1.jpg',NULL,'san-marzano-talo-primitivo-merlot-2018-it-smtpm',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:35','2021-04-09 05:39:26',0),(1694,'SAN MARZANO SESSANTANI PRIMITIVO DI MANDURIA 2017','seller',1544,12,79,96,222,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/IT-SMSPM-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/IT-SMSPM-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Italy</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Intense ruby red colour, wide and complex to the nose, fruity, with a prune and cherry jam aroma, with notes of tobacco, slightly spicy.</p>\n<p>A full-bodied wine, soft and rich in fine tannins, with notes of cocoa, coffee and vanilla in the end.</p>',83.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,120,'IT-SMSPM',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'SAN MARZANO SESSANTANI PRIMITIVO DI MANDURIA 2017','Country: Italy\r\n\r\nense ruby red colour, wide and complex to the nose, fruity, with a prune and cherry jam aroma, with notes of tobacco, slightly spicy. A full-bodied wine, soft and rich in fine tannins, with notes of cocoa, coffee and vanilla in the end.','uploads/products/photos/IT-SMSPM-.1.jpg',NULL,'san-marzano-sessantani-primitivo-di-manduria-2017-it-smspm',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:35','2021-04-09 05:39:52',0),(1695,'TOLAINI LEGIT ROSSO TOSCANA','seller',1544,12,79,96,224,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/IT-TLRT-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/IT-TLRT-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Italy</p><p></p><p>\"Don\'t play everything, let some things go by. What you don\'t play can be more important than what you do\". -Thelonious Sphere Monk</p><p></p><p>The story of LEGIT Cabernet Sauvignon began in 2016 when Lia was tasting barrels of the 2013 Cabernet Sauvignon at Tolaini with a colleague from Banville Wine Merchants. They agreed this wine was a LEGIT Cabernet Sauvignon, with a true sense of place and an Italian soul. In wanting to pursue the name LEGIT, only one person came to mind. A person who embodied stylish originality and eternal hipness, an artist referred to as the \"Genius of Modern Music\" - Thelonious Monk. LEGIT\'s striking label is an iconic photo from the album cover of one of Monk\'s most famous live concert recordings, \'Thelonious Monk in Italy\' recorded live April 21st, 1961 in Milan by Riverside Records.</p><p>After getting in touch with Thelonious Monk\'s family to secure the rights to the use of the label, an adventure that was born as a business endeavor evolved into collaboration and has ultimately grown into a wonderful friendship between the Monk and Tolaini family.</p><p>We are proud to offer this wine as a tribute to the timelessness of Monk\'s music. Pulitzer Prize winner,</p><p>respected composer (his single \"Round Midnight\" is the most recorded Jazz single to date) AND who</p><p>today is still referred to as the epitome of Jazz, Thelonious Monk has and will always set the bar for all things LEGIT!</p>',55.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,0,12,'IT-TLRT',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'TOLAINI LEGIT ROSSO TOSCANA','Country: Italy\r\n\r\n\"Don\'t play everything, let some things go by. What you don\'t play can be more important than what you do\". -Thelonious Sphere Monk\r\n\r\nThe story of LEGIT Cabernet Sauvignon began in 2016 when Lia was tasting barrels of the 2013 Cabernet Sauvignon at Tolaini with a colleague from Banville Wine Merchants. They agreed this wine was a LEGIT Cabernet Sauvignon, with a true sense of place and an Italian soul. In wanting to pursue the name LEGIT, only one person came to mind. A person who embodied stylish originality and eternal hipness, an artist referred to as the \"Genius of Modern Music\" - Thelonious Monk. LEGIT\'s striking label is an iconic photo from the album cover of one of Monk\'s most famous live concert recordings, \'Thelonious Monk in Italy\' recorded live April 21st, 1961 in Milan by Riverside Records.\r\nAfter getting in touch with Thelonious Monk\'s family to secure the rights to the use of the label, an adventure that was born as a business endeavor evolved into collaboration and has ultimately grown into a wonderful friendship between the Monk and Tolaini family.\r\nWe are proud to offer this wine as a tribute to the timelessness of Monk\'s music. Pulitzer Prize winner, respected composer (his single \"Round Midnight\" is the most recorded Jazz single to date) AND who today is still referred to as the epitome of Jazz, Thelonious Monk has and will always set the bar for all things LEGIT!','uploads/products/photos/IT-TLRT-.1.jpg',NULL,'tolaini-legit-rosso-toscana-it-tlrt',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:35','2021-04-10 02:57:30',0),(1696,'CASA SANTOS LIMA PORRAIS BLANCO 2017/2018','seller',1544,12,79,97,206,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/PT-CSLPB-.1.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/PT-CSLPB-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Country: Portugal</p><p></p><p>Mineral aroma with citrus notes. Fruity and mineral notes.</p>',50.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,24,'PT-CSLPB',1,NULL,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'CASA SANTOS LIMA PORRAIS BLANCO 2017/2018','Country: Portugal\r\n\r\nMineral aroma with citrus notes. Fruity and mineral notes.','uploads/products/photos/PT-CSLPB-.1.jpg',NULL,'casa-santos-lima-porrais-blanco-2017-2018-pt-cslpb',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-03-23 10:04:36','2021-04-09 05:41:22',0),(1697,'Energizer WCP-105 Wireless Charging Pad','seller',1540,15,94,104,229,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/842982103122-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/842982103122-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/842982103122-.3.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/842982103122-.4.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/842982103122-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>Energizer WCP-105 15W wireless charging pad is designed with ultra-high output that can support up to 15W fast charge for any Qi-compatible devices. WCP-105 of