It contains pure and natural ingredients, its skin safety and the effect of use were enhamced and it is available for sensitive skin by adding the function to make skin soothing.</P><P>It makes to open up the blocked pores and remove sebum, blackheads and whiteheads by wiping out the dirts and residues on the skin.</P><P></P><P>2. How to use</P><P>Adhere a Blackhead off cotton mask on the nose area and spread the mask evenly with your fingers.</P><P>Leave the mask on for at least 15 minutes for maximum results then remove.</P><P>Wipe exposed sebum, blackheads and whiteheads with a clean cotton swab or pad.</P><P>Tip: It is better to open pores before applying the sheet by using warm water or steamed towel. Please do not let it sit to dry up. </P><P>The mask should stay moist. For longer lasting moist on the mask, you can wrap the area with plastic wrap</P><P>Caution: For external use only. Avoid the immediate eye area </P><P></P><P>3. Ingredients</P><P>Water, Hamamelis Virginiana (Witch Hazel) Water, Viscum Album (Mistletoe) Extract, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Extract, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Extract, Melissa Officinalis Extract, Juniperus Communis Fruit Extract, Butylene Glycol, Arctium Majus Root Extract, Phenoxyethanol, Saponaria Officinalis Leaf/Root Extract, Methylparaben, Hypericum Perforatum Extract, PPG-1-PEG-9 Lauryl Glycol Ether, Coceth-7, Allantoin, (-)-alpha-bisabolol, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Ascorbic Acid, Limonene</P>',31.20,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,0,'PCT-CRC-00020',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'0',0.00,0.00,0,'Ciracle Blackhead Off Cotton Mask 5ml','<P1. Ciracle Blackhead Off Cotton Mask is a 100% cotton mask containing the dissolvent to macerate sebum, Blackhead and whitehead.</P><P>It helps to care of pores of nose area by dissolving sebum, blackheads and whiteheads without any irritating the skin.</P><P>The miracle of 15 minutes! </P><P>It is the patch type and wrap