s to use and quiet operation</p><p></p><p>-CADR : 170m3/hr </p>',299.00,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,1,1,50,'HPA100',1,60.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'Honeywell True Allergen Remover air purifier HPA100','<p>The new ENERGY STAR qualified, Honeywell True HEPA Allergen Remover effectively captures up to 99.97% of airborne allergens, 0.3 microns and larger, that pass through the filters. This air purifier is highly effective at capturing airborne particles such as dust, smoke, pollen, pet dander and mold spores in medium rooms (5x air changes per hour in a 155. sq. ft.). An odor reducing pre-filter and True HEPA filter are paired to capture odors, VOCs, allergens and germs. The Honeywell HPA100 True HEPA Air Purifier with Allergen Remover offers easy tap controls and an automatic shut off timer.</p><p></p><p></p><p>- Room size cover up to 26m2/ 279sqft</p><p>- Captures up to 99.97% of microscopic allergens such as molds, spores, pollen, dust, smoke, pet dander</p><p></p><p>- Helps reduce unpleasant household odors and VOCs/gases</p><p></p><p>- 4 speed setting</p><p></p><p>- Filter replacement indicator reminder</p><p></p><p>- Timer 2-4-8 hours</p><p></p><p>- Effortless to use and quiet operation</p><p></p><p>-CADR : 170m3/hr </p>','uploads/products/photos/HPA100-.1.jpg',NULL,'honeywell-true-allergen-remover-air-purifier-hpa100-hpa100',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-15 04:05:49','2021-04-16 15:19:08',0),(1965,'Honeywell Premium air purifier, HPA710WE1','seller',1549,16,112,NULL,232,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/HPA710-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/HPA710-.2.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/HPA710-.3.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/HPA710-.4.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/HPA710-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>The Advantages of the Premium Honeywell HPA710 air cleaner is that it has another pre-filter. In addition, it has a switchable Ionizer, which can still provide odor-free air and the air quality indicator displays the air qu