ood. Preserve the fresh flavours of your favourite ingredients and meals in your fridge, freezer and cupboards.</p><p>4 x container for your storage use</p><p>Compatible with all FoodSaver® vacuum sealing systems</p><p>Suitable for the fridge, freezer and cupboard</p><p>BPA Free – safe for all the family</p><p>Store liquids or dry goods with leak proof lid and seal</p>',89.90,0.00,0,'[]','[]','[]',NULL,0,0,0,20,'FA4SC3358T2002',1,20.00,'amount',NULL,'amount','0',0.00,0.00,0,'FoodSaver® Fresh Containers 4pcs set','<p>FoodSaver® Fresh Containers are stylish, stackable and suitable for use with all FoodSaver® Vacuum Sealing Systems. These are the ultimate food storage solutions for your home – the combination of simple storage and the freshness you can expect from vacuum sealing your food. Preserve the fresh flavours of your favourite ingredients and meals in your fridge, freezer and cupboards.</p><p>4 x container for your storage use</p><p>Compatible with all FoodSaver® vacuum sealing systems</p><p>Suitable for the fridge, freezer and cupboard</p><p>BPA Free – safe for all the family</p><p>Store liquids or dry goods with leak proof lid and seal</p>','uploads/products/photos/FA4SC3358T2002-.1.jpg',NULL,'foodsaver-fresh-containers-4pcs-set-fa4sc3358t2002',0,0.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'2021-04-15 04:05:50','2021-04-16 15:27:53',0),(1980,'FoodSaver® FreshSaver® 950ml Zipper Bags (18pcs)','seller',1549,16,110,NULL,235,'[\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FSFRBZ0216073-.1.jpg\",\"uploads\\/products\\/photos\\/FSFRBZ0216073-.2.jpg\"]','uploads/products/photos/FSFRBZ0216073-.1.jpg','youtube',NULL,'','<p>FoodSaver® FreshSaver® 950ml Zipper Bags are ideal for storing frequently accessed foods in the refrigerator or pantry. Use FoodSaver® FreshSaver® zipper bags to store deli meats, cheeses, dried or fresh fruits, nuts and snacks, baked goods, cookies and more. The 950ml-sized zipper bags feature a convenient gusseted bottom that lays flat on a counter or table top for easy filling.</p>