x; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">20201211-17364962</span>&nbsp;(amount paid $74). However, as bank fees of $5 are involved for the credit card charge, we will have to pass that on to you. Are you ok with for me to proceed and&nbsp;seek for approval?</p><p>Should you encounter the same issue in the future, you may check your customer account&nbsp;to verify if your order has been processed and confirm. Alternatively, please feel free to raise a ticket or&nbsp;reach&nbsp;us on our Live Chat during office hours.</p><p>Please advise soon.</p><p>Thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:13:47','2020-12-12 15:13:47'),(91,12,9,'<p>Hi Joseph,</p><p>We have confirmed that the price is for 1 doll.</p><p>Thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:18:28','2020-12-12 15:18:28'),(92,14,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:18:57','2020-12-12 15:18:57'),(93,18,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:19:32','2020-12-12 15:19:32'),(94,40,1221,'Hi, yes I\'m fine with the bank charges. Please proceed with approval request',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:20:55','2020-12-12 15:20:55'),(95,11,9,'<p>Hi Yi Ke,</p><p>We are sorry for the your bad experience with the product. We have made the necessary refund to your credit card and you may do as you deem fit with the product.</p><p>Thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:24:36','2020-12-12 15:24:36'),(96,20,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:25:09','2020-12-12 15:25:09'),(97,12,316,'Hi, thank you.',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:33:28','2020-12-12 15:33:28'),(98,21,1261,'<p>Dear customer,&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for your patience and reaching out to us. We apologize for the delay in response as we are experiencing a high volume of queries.</p><p>We\'re sorry to hear about this. Kindly give us sometime and we will get back to you on this matter as soon as possible</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:41:23','2020-12-12 15:41:23'),(99,40,9,'<p>Hi Sebastien,</p><p>We are pleased to inform you that we have gotten approval to proceed with cancelling order number&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(3, 145, 209); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">20201211-17364962</span>.</p><p>We will proceed to do a refund of $69 ($74 - $5 bank fees) to your credit card next week when office reopen. The refund will take up to 10 days to be reflected on your credit card statement.</p><p>Wishing you a pleasant weekend.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:45:36','2020-12-12 15:45:36'),(100,12,9,'Wishing a pleasant weekend!',NULL,'2020-12-12 15:46:27','2020-12-12 15:46:27'),(101,43,142,'Hello, I am&nbsp;unable to attach the photos and they tell me something is wrong. Please let me know how else I can send across the photos. Thanks!&nbsp;',NULL,'2020-12-12 16:35:20','2020-12-12 16:35:20'),(102,24,9,'<p>Hi Allen,</p><p>Your order was handed over to the delivery provider on 10 Dec. We trust that you have received your order and is now enjoying the merchandise.&nbsp;</p><p>Enjoy your weekend and thank you for making your purchase on YSG &nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 19:30:29','2020-12-12 19:30:29'),(103,29,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:06:10','2020-12-12 21:06:10'),(104,13,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:07:13','2020-12-12 21:07:13'),(105,26,9,'<p>Hi Season,</p><p>We trust that you have received your order and we hope you are enjoying your merchandise.</p><p>Have a blessed weekend.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:10:47','2020-12-12 21:10:47'),(106,21,9,'<p>Hi Michelle,</p><p>We have checked and confirmed that your order has been processed and we trust that you have received your merchandise.</p><p>We hope you will enjoy the products and have a pleasant weekend.<br></p>','[{\"name\":\"order-20201127-21224368.pdf\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/qMT1v1lXh04XGimh3l6adhy17hycry7gdjATnryY.bin\"}]','2020-12-12 21:16:26','2020-12-12 21:16:26'),(107,19,9,'<p>Hi Shannon,</p><p>We apologise for the bad technical experience. We have feedback to the technical team to investigate and resolve.</p><p>We have checked your order and we trust that you have receive it and we hope that you are enjoying your merchandise. Thank you for making your purchase with us and have a pleasant weekend!</p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:33:34','2020-12-12 21:33:34'),(108,22,9,'<p>Hi Joseph,</p><p>Thank you for your purchase. As orders are sent to the fulfillment centre for processing amongst other orders, we are unable to add another products after the order had been processed.</p><p>We trust that you have received your order and we hope that you will enjoy the merchandise.</p><p>Have a blessed weekend!<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:37:46','2020-12-12 21:37:46'),(109,9,9,'<p>Hi Tania,</p><p>Thank you for shopping on YSG. We trust that you have received your order and we hope you will enjoy the merchandise.</p><p>Wishing you a very pleasant weekend ahead!<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:41:50','2020-12-12 21:41:50'),(110,8,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:42:33','2020-12-12 21:42:33'),(111,7,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:43:02','2020-12-12 21:43:02'),(112,5,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:43:32','2020-12-12 21:43:32'),(113,4,9,'.',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:44:04','2020-12-12 21:44:04'),(114,3,9,'<p>Dear Customer,</p><p>We apologise for the double charged at the bank\'s end on your credit card. Please rest assured that $697 has been refunded to your credit card and it will be reflected on your card statement within 10 days.</p><p>Thank you for making your purchase with us and we hope you will visit us again.</p><p>Have a pleasant weekend.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:49:52','2020-12-12 21:49:52'),(115,43,9,'<p>Hi Alexia,</p><p>No worries, you may email us at cs@ysg.com.sg</p><p>We also noticed you have made 8 orders with us. We thank you for your patronage. Can you please confirm that the affected items are from the following Order Number&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(3, 145, 209); font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">20201127-20274078</span>? If so, please use that as the Subject Title of your email and address the email to <strong>Hilton</strong></p><p>Thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-12 21:59:41','2020-12-12 21:59:41'),(116,22,316,'Noted with many thanks.',NULL,'2020-12-12 22:25:03','2020-12-12 22:25:03'),(117,43,142,'Hello, yes that’s right. Those products were from that order. I will drop a separate email. thank you!&nbsp;<br>',NULL,'2020-12-12 22:27:08','2020-12-12 22:27:08'),(118,21,332,'I’ve received my order, thanks&nbsp;',NULL,'2020-12-13 08:00:49','2020-12-13 08:00:49'),(119,5,478,'<p>Thanks for the follow up. &nbsp;&nbsp;will check. &nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Regards,&nbsp;</p><p>Stephanie&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-13 11:52:30','2020-12-13 11:52:30'),(120,5,9,'No problem. Wishing you a Happy Sunday!',NULL,'2020-12-13 14:58:07','2020-12-13 14:58:07'),(121,21,9,'You are most welcome and thank you for shopping with YSG!',NULL,'2020-12-13 14:59:03','2020-12-13 14:59:03'),(122,22,9,'No problem, Wishing a Happy Sunday!',NULL,'2020-12-13 15:00:06','2020-12-13 15:00:06'),(123,43,9,'Thank you Alexia! Wishing you a Happy Sunday!',NULL,'2020-12-13 15:01:01','2020-12-13 15:01:01'),(124,44,9,'<p>Hi Jenny,</p><p>Thank you for reaching out. We will check internally when office resumes tomorrow and revert.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-13 15:29:57','2020-12-13 15:29:57'),(125,38,293,'I attached it in the last message. But here it is again.',NULL,'2020-12-14 01:10:12','2020-12-14 01:10:12'),(126,38,293,'I can\'t seem to see the pictures I attached for you. Are you able to see it? I attached it one more time here.',NULL,'2020-12-14 01:13:04','2020-12-14 01:13:04'),(127,38,9,'<p>Hi Maria,</p><p>We are not seeing the pictures too. Could you email to us at </p><p>cs@ysg.com.sg&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please kindly address to Hilton and quote your Order Confirmation Number.</p><p>You have a great start to the week!</p>',NULL,'2020-12-14 11:47:00','2020-12-14 11:47:00'),(128,45,9,'<p>Good morning Sharon,</p><p>First and foremost, please accept our apologies for the bad experience you had encountered with your purchase. We will reach out to the Seller immediately to seek a resolution and revert.</p><p>In the meantime, would you mind sending us pictures of the item to</p><p>cs@ysg.com.sg</p><p>Please kindly quote your order confirmation number relating to this particular purchase as we noticed that you had placed 4 orders with us. You may address the email to Hilton.</p><p>Please rest assured we will resolve this matter for you as soon as possible. Thank you.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-14 12:01:58','2020-12-14 12:01:58'),(129,44,9,'<p>Dear Jenny,</p><p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    We refer to your recent purchase of the Jayjun Anti-Dust Facial Mask (“Product”) from YSG. </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">It has come to our attention that the Product has passed its expiry date and we have since taken the necessary steps to delist the Product from our Platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">We will be refunding the cost of the Product to your credit card. It will take approximately between 5-10 working days for the refunded amount to be reflected\r\n    in your card statement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">We are deeply sorry for this regrettable incident.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Should you require any clarification with this email, please reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:cs@ysg.com.sg\" style=\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\">cs@ysg.com.sg</a> or on the chatbot on our website <a href=\"http://www.ysg.com.sg\" style=\"color: blue; text-decoration: underline;\">www.ysg.com.sg</a>    between 0900-1800hrs, Mondays to Fridays.</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Thank you for your support of YSG and for giving us the opportunity to serve you.</p></p>',NULL,'2020-12-14 14:41:17','2020-12-14 14:41:17'),(130,45,9,'<p>Hi Sharon,</p><p>We trust that the warehouse team has already been in touch with you to arrange for&nbsp;a one-to-one exchange of the watch. We thank you for your patience and for choosing to shop at YSG.</p><p>We hope your mum would be very happy to receive the&nbsp;thoughtful gift you have prepared especially for her.</p><p>Wishing you and your family a very blessed festive season ahead!</p>',NULL,'2020-12-15 13:28:22','2020-12-15 13:28:22'),(131,48,984,'<p>Hi Chen Shao,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your message. From what I can see, the logistics provider has already picked up your order from our warehouse and the parcel is on the way to you. </p><p><br></p><p>Sincere apologies for any inconvenience caused. Please feel free to let us know should you have any other enquiries.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you and have a nice day! :)&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-16 07:08:24','2020-12-16 07:08:24'),(132,47,984,'<p>Hello Brenda,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in. Your order has already been picked up by our logistics provider on 7 Dec 2020, please allow me some time to check with the relevant party before I revert back to you.</p><p><br></p><p>Sincere apologies for the delay, please be assured that we are doing our best to better facilitate this process.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day. :)&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-16 07:17:42','2020-12-16 07:17:42'),(133,24,448,'Hi, Noted with thank you for your reply.',NULL,'2020-12-16 09:00:59','2020-12-16 09:00:59'),(134,47,711,'<p>Hi Jackson,</p><p>Thanks for the speedy reply. Please update me ASAP. I really looking forward to reply my items soon. As it really too very long to deliver to me. And I am worry that the parcel is lost or the courier guy cannot get me as i seldom at home.</p><p>thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 01:10:40','2020-12-17 01:10:40'),(135,50,1286,'<p>Hi Wei Chen,&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for writing to us. Our brand owners give massive discounts on these products. Items that are nearing expiry that is&nbsp;sold in this private sale will have their expiry date shown in the product description. We have attached it here for ease of reference.&nbsp;</p><p>Rest assured that YSG will stay committed to listing original and authentic products of high quality for our customers.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for your kind understanding.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','[{\"name\":\"Lindt Napolitains.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/iTchFfecC4TcVN0rO0zj4MKOn9QfeCUMNNTh9rpc.png\"}]','2020-12-17 01:20:18','2020-12-17 01:20:18'),(136,2,418,'<p>Hi</p><p>The transactions were a system issue on your end. I only made one transaction. As explained, I made one transaction and the first returned an error message. I went ahead to make another transaction and the second one went through. This is a system issue on your website and you are not refunding your customer?</p><p>#1 - I made one transaction but was charged three times. I did not make any authorisation for the other two transactions&nbsp;to go through. This is a fault in your system.</p><p>#2 - Due to your system issue, I was being charged thrice and have to go through the pains of seeking for a refund, but am informed that i can’t do so? That’s unreasonable, because your customers will be charged twice/thrice the amount they had authorised to pay.</p><p>Please re-consider the refund request, else, I will be raising this as&nbsp;a dispute. Thank you.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 02:46:59','2020-12-17 02:46:59'),(137,51,984,'<p>Good day Dr Vyas Prasad,</p><p><br></p><p>Your order has already been packed, we are currently waiting for the third party logistics provider to collect the order and deliver it to you.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your patience. Have a nice day! :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 03:32:22','2020-12-17 03:32:22'),(138,51,984,'<p>Good day Dr Vyas Prasad,</p><p><br></p><p>Your order has already been packed, we are currently waiting for the third party logistics provider to collect the order and deliver it to you.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your patience. Have a nice day! :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 03:32:24','2020-12-17 03:32:24'),(139,2,1286,'<p>Hi&nbsp;Calvin,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Sorry for your experience. Can we confirm the following before we proceed with a refund, please?</p><p>1) Have both orders been successfully delivered?<br>2) None of the duplicated orders has been consumed, touched, or meddled with?</p><p><br></p><p>To facilitate a refund, all items must be received by us in order for a customer to be eligible for a refund or replacement. You shall ensure that the Product is sent to us in the same condition as it was when received by you and is packaged properly.&nbsp;<br><br>If the item has not been open and remains&nbsp;untouched, we will get it picked up, and once verified that all items are in the conditions as when it was sent out, we will go ahead to process the refund.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Once again,&nbsp;sorry for the experience and we look forward to your reply so we may sort this issue out for you earliest possible.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks!</p><p>YSG Team</p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 04:59:02','2020-12-17 04:59:02'),(140,53,1286,'<p>Hi Iain,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing to us. We are checking on your order for you. As we do not have visibility of our brand partner\'s logistic services, please give us some time to check on this for you.&nbsp;</p><p><br>We thank you for your kind patience, we will revert once we have a status update.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>YSG Team</p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 05:10:10','2020-12-17 05:10:10'),(141,52,1286,'<p>Hi Isabel,</p><p>Thanks for writing to us.&nbsp;<br><br>Your refund has been processed and it should show in your card statement within 5-10 working days.&nbsp;</p><p>Our orders are backed by a line of machines and workers, orders which have errors would be taken out to be processed separately. The assignment of packing job is random based on the the next available worker.&nbsp;</p><p>In your case, we believe that it could be due to multiple items that was affected and it was pulled out from the queue.&nbsp;</p><p>We apologize for the inconvenience caused and thank you for your understanding.&nbsp;</p><p>YSG Team&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 05:17:43','2020-12-17 05:17:43'),(142,2,418,'<p>Hi&nbsp;</p><p>1) yes</p><p>2) confirming that none of the duplicated goods have been meddled. Goods are in the same condition as per delivered.</p><p>thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-17 15:49:21','2020-12-17 15:49:21'),(143,2,1286,'<p>Good Morning Calvin,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>That\'s great! I will go ahead to arrange for a pick up of your order so I can expedite this case for you. I will get the logistics team to contact you to arrange a time with you.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Sincere apologies for the inconvenience caused and thank you for your kind patience and understanding.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>YSG Team</p>',NULL,'2020-12-18 02:10:26','2020-12-18 02:10:26'),(144,55,1286,'<p>Good Morning Sebastien,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing to us. We can see on our status that your order is awaiting pick up from the logistics team. Rest assured that our teams are working overtime trying to get all orders shipped out as soon as possible.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you for your kind patience.&nbsp;</p><p>YSG Team</p>',NULL,'2020-12-18 02:15:18','2020-12-18 02:15:18'),(145,49,1286,'<p>Good Morning,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We\'ve had a check on your order and it shows that it\'s in line to be packed. Rest assured that our teams are working tirelessly to get all orders out for delivery as soon as possible.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your kind patience and understanding.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>YSG Team&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-18 02:19:09','2020-12-18 02:19:09'),(146,54,1286,'anything',NULL,'2020-12-18 05:51:15','2020-12-18 05:51:15'),(147,54,1286,'<p>Hi Janicer, we see&nbsp;we have received your chat message too. Going forward we will communicate in the chat, is that okay ?&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>If there is anything we can help you with, our agents on the chat can help answer your questions. Thank you.<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-18 05:52:25','2020-12-18 05:52:25'),(148,54,776,'Hello thank you for the reply. Can i check the status of my parcel, because the person told me via the chat that your system recorded it as \'delivered\'.&nbsp;',NULL,'2020-12-18 13:10:43','2020-12-18 13:10:43'),(149,56,213,'<p>hello. i have ordered these 2 items but have received different as descriptions.</p><p><br></p><p>marc jacobs was supposed to be yellow but i got a blue one which is different totally in scent / description&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>dior was supposed to be edp but i got edt</p>','[{\"name\":\"Screenshot_20201219-132020.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/VstaEfMx0YRv7hINJCmGahg8ApSGNQrbgzybWUjp.png\"},{\"name\":\"PXL_20201219_052248201.jpg\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/fF14d3R9gX7LRxxcuWmBAXRk0tQ8NLPrYz6uiBps.jpeg\"},{\"name\":\"Screenshot_20201219-131952.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/9qB3uuY0Ylij62Lg3fDz7w15jPJdmczTH8OBXaQu.png\"},{\"name\":\"PXL_20201219_051855909.jpg\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/9gP1ifClZjlDzgOoktdxRSbR8iaFKg1K4Nvf5wn4.jpeg\"}]','2020-12-19 05:27:38','2020-12-19 05:27:38'),(150,58,984,'<p>Hi Lucas</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day! :)</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 01:46:55','2020-12-21 01:46:55'),(151,58,984,'<p>Hi Lucas</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day! :)</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 01:46:57','2020-12-21 01:46:57'),(152,56,984,'<p>Hi CHING,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please allow us some time to investigate this issue before we revert.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>In the meantime, please let us know if you have any other enquiries.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 01:52:39','2020-12-21 01:52:39'),(153,61,984,'<p>Good day Cristina,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in. Your orders are already packed and we are currently awaiting for the third party logistics company to retrieve it for dispatch.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We will keep you updated once again when the parcel has been handed over to the logistics company.</p><p><br></p><p>Please let us know if you have any other queries, have a nice day! :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 03:21:39','2020-12-21 03:21:39'),(154,49,984,'<p>Good day Hari,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Your parcel has already been handed over to the third party logistics partner for delivery on 19 Dec. You should be expecting your parcel within the next few days.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please feel free to let us know should you have any other questions.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day. :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 03:27:00','2020-12-21 03:27:00'),(155,57,984,'<p>-</p>',NULL,'2020-12-21 03:27:57','2020-12-21 03:27:57'),(156,62,984,'<p>Good day Celeste,</p><p><br></p><p>Your parcel is scheduled to be&nbsp;picked up today by our third party logistics provider, you should be expecting your order in the next few days.</p><p><br></p><p>We apologize for any inconvenience caused and thank you so much for your patience.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a good day! :)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-22 04:40:29','2020-12-22 04:40:29'),(157,63,984,'<p>Hi Candy,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Due to the high volume of orders, we are unable to advise a fixed date for your order.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Seek your kind understanding and patience, thank you.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Hope this clarifies, have a nice day! :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-22 05:49:48','2020-12-22 05:49:48'),(158,61,984,'<p>Hi Cristina,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Your order has been handed over to the&nbsp;third party logistics company today, and you should be expecting your order from 10 Dec in the next few days to come.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your patience and sincere apologies for any inconvenience caused.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day! :)&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-22 06:00:38','2020-12-22 06:00:38'),(159,60,984,'-',NULL,'2020-12-22 07:41:43','2020-12-22 07:41:43'),(160,59,984,'-',NULL,'2020-12-22 07:42:00','2020-12-22 07:42:00'),(161,54,984,'<p>Good day Janicer,</p><p><br></p><p>May I check if you have already received your order?</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-22 07:50:06','2020-12-22 07:50:06'),(162,47,984,'<p>Hi Brenda,</p><p><br></p><p>May I check with you if you have already received your order?</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-22 07:53:47','2020-12-22 07:53:47'),(163,56,213,'hello. any reply yet? my items are intended to be for christmas gift and christmas is in 2 days.',NULL,'2020-12-23 01:58:24','2020-12-23 01:58:24'),(164,56,984,'<p>Hi CHING,</p><p><br></p><p>Apologies for the delay as we are currently investigating this issue. May I trouble you to provide me the SKU number on the boxes please?&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-23 04:32:38','2020-12-23 04:32:38'),(165,56,984,'<p>Hi CHING,</p><p><br></p><p>The SKU number is the product code handwritten on the label that comes with the box.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-23 05:04:26','2020-12-23 05:04:26'),(166,53,1286,'<p>Hi Iain,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We have been notified that you have received your orders by now. We will go ahead to close this ticket.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for shopping with us and Happy Holidays from YSG!<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-24 03:01:55','2020-12-24 03:01:55'),(167,65,1286,'<p>Good Morning Celeste,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Can we check if you are referring to order number&nbsp;20201210-18441421?</p><p><br></p><p>If so, there were items that were cancelled and refunded previously. We have notified you via email on that on 14 December.&nbsp;</p><p>If you are referring to another order, please kindly let us have the order number to do a check for you.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you&nbsp;</p><p>YSG Team<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-24 03:07:39','2020-12-24 03:07:39'),(168,64,1286,'<p>Hi Hannah,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We have received notification that your order has been delivered. We will go ahead to close this ticket.&nbsp;</p><p>Do reach out to us if you have any other questions</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for shopping with us!</p><p><br></p><p>YSG Team<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-24 03:27:48','2020-12-24 03:27:48'),(169,56,213,'<p>dior #1090836 - i&nbsp;bought 3 and 2 of them are the correct EDP and the remaining 1 is EDT which is not the correct item</p><p>marc jacobs - i could not wait and have already given it away as gift<br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-24 04:22:57','2020-12-24 04:22:57'),(170,56,1286,'<p>Hi Ching,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks for coming back with the information, we are investigating this with our warehouse team.&nbsp;</p><p>We will revert when we have an update. Thank you for your kind patience and apologies for the inconvenience.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-24 08:40:03','2020-12-24 08:40:03'),(171,67,984,'<p>Hi June Ye,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your purchase. Your order has already been handed over to the third party logistics provider on 23 Dec, you should be able to receive in the next 2-3 working days.</p><p><br></p><p>Hope this clarifies, please let us know if you have any other enquiries.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day! :)&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-28 03:28:36','2020-12-28 03:28:36'),(172,56,213,'hi. it\'s been quite some time already. i want a refund for the wrong item if you are still unable to get an answer. i can return you the item. please get back as soon as possible with an answer and not tell me to wait further. thanks.&nbsp;',NULL,'2020-12-28 05:30:11','2020-12-28 05:30:11'),(173,68,984,'<p>Good day Poh Yun,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in. First and foremost, we would like to sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>May I trouble you to take a photo of the Michael Kors MK2893 Watch that you received please? Please also provide me with the serial number of the product on the watch.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-28 05:36:41','2020-12-28 05:36:41'),(174,2,1286,'<p>Hi Calvin,&nbsp;</p><p>I believe my logistics team has been trying to arrange a date to pick this order up so we may process the refund for you. If you would still like a refund, kindly do so before the 31st of December as we have to close the books for the month. Any requests after the 31 will not be accepted. Noting that all Outlet Products and Private Sales Products sold on this platform do not qualify for any returns and refunds. I have managed to seek an exception&nbsp;for your case, but we have to do so before the 31.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you</p><p>YSG Team<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-29 08:43:11','2020-12-29 08:43:11'),(175,56,213,'hello? christmas is already over. am i supposed to wait till chinese new year before you give me a reply? i have received 2 wrongs orders in my delivery that was delivered to me almost 2 weeks ago.',NULL,'2020-12-30 01:43:40','2020-12-30 01:43:40'),(176,56,1286,'<p>Hi Ching, apologies for the silence, as the warehouse is going through stocktake immediately after the sale, they are trying their best to investigate this matter. Do not worry as we have put this as an urgent case, we will get back to you on this with an update today.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your patience.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 02:07:20','2020-12-30 02:07:20'),(177,66,984,'<p>Hi Hannah,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in. Please allow us some time to investigate this issue&nbsp;on our end before we revert to you with an update.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Should you have any other queries, please feel free to let us know.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 02:13:57','2020-12-30 02:13:57'),(178,66,984,'<p>Hi Hannah,</p><p><br></p><p>Can you also kindly provide me with the SKU number on the box of the item that you received please?&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 02:19:13','2020-12-30 02:19:13'),(179,66,984,'<p>Hi Hannah,</p><p><br></p><p>If possible, please also provide us with photos of the items you received. Photos of the packaging and photos of the barcode number on the box will be sufficient.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Sorry for any inconvenience caused.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 04:07:23','2020-12-30 04:07:23'),(180,69,984,'<p>Hi June Ye,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for writing in. According to my database, your order has been received and signed for on 23 Dec.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Please check and let us know if you have any updates.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day. :)&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 06:37:14','2020-12-30 06:37:14'),(181,69,347,'<p>I didn\'t receive anything !</p><p>no calls came to me as well.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 06:51:47','2020-12-30 06:51:47'),(182,69,347,'<p>My address was clearly mentioned below:</p><p>140d corporation drive 02-76, Singapore, 614140, Singapore</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 06:54:36','2020-12-30 06:54:36'),(183,69,984,'<p>Hi June Ye,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your prompt reply. </p><p><br></p><p>Attached in this email is the proof of delivery, seek your kind help in verifying the details please.</p><p><br></p><p>Please let us know if you have any other queries.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>','[{\"name\":\"Proof of Delivery Signature (June Ye).jpeg\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/UM4WFglyW4znTwnkQ5DPqxa9L7aOqTdnHUtLWvTH.jpeg\"}]','2020-12-30 07:47:28','2020-12-30 07:47:28'),(184,69,347,'<p>I didn\'t read anything on 23th Dec. And my phone number is 97272197.</p><p>This is not a sufficient proof that delivered to me. Can you check if anyone revd the item or just drop outside my door ???</p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 08:07:15','2020-12-30 08:07:15'),(185,69,347,'<p>Can somebody call me urgently regarding this matter ?</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you .</p><p>my phone number 97272197<br></p><p><br></p><p>Ye&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 08:09:43','2020-12-30 08:09:43'),(186,69,347,'<p>Even though my phone number was incorrect but my home address was correct.</p><p>Please check when delivery came on 23rd Dec ? I have no revd anything.</p><p><br></p><p>Please help.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.</p><p><br></p><p>Ye</p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 08:18:53','2020-12-30 08:18:53'),(187,69,984,'<p>Hi June Ye,</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for your reply.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We have already escalated this issue to the relevant department, please allow us some time to investigate this matter. A representative of our company will call&nbsp;you as soon as we have done all the proper procedures.</p><p><br></p><p>In the meantime, please feel free to let us know here should you have any other enquiries.</p><p><br></p><p>Appreciate your kind patience and deepest apologies for any inconvenience caused.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 08:54:14','2020-12-30 08:54:14'),(188,69,347,'<p>Dear Support.</p><p>Thank you for helping.</p><p>Thank you for understand my situation and assist me with my pracal trace.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">Happy new year to you.</span></p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.</p><p><br></p><p>Ye&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-30 09:04:05','2020-12-30 09:04:05'),(189,56,213,'<p>hello. it\'s been a day and i have yet to receive any updates despite your last reply saying that you will get back to me with an update yesterday.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-31 02:15:14','2020-12-31 02:15:14'),(190,56,984,'<p>Good day CHING,\r\n</p><p>\r\nFirst and foremost, we would like to offer our sincerest apologies for the inconvenience caused. </p><p>\r\n\r\nAfter a thorough investigation, we have determined that there might have been an error made during the labeling process, which caused the similar products to be put together. </p><p>\r\n\r\nMay I ask if you would like to keep the Dior Eau De Toilette? Noting that the sale is over and its a steal for a product at that price? \r\n\r\nIf you feel otherwise, we are happy to arrange a pick-up of the item from you, and then proceed to refund you the amount of 15 SGD, do note that the product will be subjected to an assessment by the brand owners on the returned product. </p><p>\r\n\r\nShould you have any other queries, please feel free to let us know.\r\n\r\nThank you.</p>',NULL,'2020-12-31 02:40:06','2020-12-31 02:40:06'),(191,65,984,'<p>Good morning Celeste,</p><p><br></p><p>We will go ahead and close this support ticket as we have not heard from you for some time.</p><p><br></p><p>Alternatively, please feel free to&nbsp;raise another support ticket should you have any other enquiries.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you and have a nice day :)&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2020-12-31 02:54:15','2020-12-31 02:54:15'),(192,66,1061,'<p><br></p>',NULL,'2021-01-01 12:28:55','2021-01-01 12:28:55'),(193,66,1061,'SKU 1277915',NULL,'2021-01-01 12:30:04','2021-01-01 12:30:04'),(194,66,1061,'<p>&nbsp; -<br></p>',NULL,'2021-01-01 12:31:14','2021-01-01 12:31:14'),(195,66,1061,'-',NULL,'2021-01-01 12:31:41','2021-01-01 12:31:41'),(196,66,984,'<p>Good day Hannah,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you for the information.</p><p><br></p><p> May I also trouble you to send a photo of the product you received please? The photo would be used for verification purposes.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'2021-01-04 01:47:02','2021-01-04 01:47:02'),(197,66,984,'<p>Hi Hannah,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>We regret&nbsp;to inform you that an exchange would not be possible as the private sale has already concluded. May I ask if you would like to keep the&nbsp;Lancome Absolue Precious Cells Advanced Youthful Lotion? </p><p><br></p><p>If not, we can arrange a pick-up of the product from you and then proceed to&nbsp;refund you.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Apologies for any inconvenience caused.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2021-01-04 06:26:41','2021-01-04 06:26:41'),(198,68,984,'<p>Hi Poh Yun,</p><p><br></p><p>As we have not heard from you for a while, we will go ahead and close this support ticket.</p><p><br></p><p>Should you have any other enquiry, please feel free to raise another support ticket.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2021-01-04 06:27:58','2021-01-04 06:27:58'),(199,66,984,'<p>Hi Hannah,</p><p><br></p><p>As we have not heard from you for a while, we will go ahead and close this support ticket.</p><p><br></p><p>Should you have any other enquiry, please feel free to raise another support ticket.</p><p><br></p><p>Have a nice day.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2021-01-11 06:47:01','2021-01-11 06:47:01'),(200,70,806,'Hello?! Any reply?!',NULL,'2021-01-25 08:53:20','2021-01-25 08:53:20'),(201,71,983,'<p>Hi Claire,&nbsp;</p><p>We are sincerely sorry on your missing order. Our warehouse team is checking with the Logistic Partner on your order.&nbsp;</p><p>Please allow us sometime before revert to you.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you&nbsp;</p><p>Best Regards,&nbsp;</p><p>YSG Team<br></p>',NULL,'2021-01-25 09:11:56','2021-01-25 09:11:56');
