der','Hi, I would like to add some items to my last order from today. Is that still possible and I also saw that there is an employee promo code, which I‘d like to use. Thank you!&nbsp;','[{\"name\":\"7AFFCBD7-3021-4878-B1D2-8DCC366F1435.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/ZwcxTI5lPdQaoWtjf2URZU7u8CelaMHl0UqodqYL.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 05:54:34','2020-12-12 13:54:34'),(34,2147483647,288,'Order','Hi, I would like to add some items to my last order from today. Is that still possible and I also saw that there is an employee promo code, which I‘d like to use. Thank you!&nbsp;','[{\"name\":\"7AFFCBD7-3021-4878-B1D2-8DCC366F1435.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/wA7lYD4JgTCGxQraDdyzzKKVDLzqW39Lj12pRA2C.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 06:54:46','2020-12-12 14:54:46'),(35,2147483647,288,'Order','Hi, I would like to add some items to my last order from today. Is that still possible and I also saw that there is an employee promo code, which I‘d like to use. Thank you!&nbsp;','[{\"name\":\"7AFFCBD7-3021-4878-B1D2-8DCC366F1435.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/IOKM9VISfqBXGimNiVJKM7T01kLT2nXikGKZ4fcs.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 05:56:43','2020-12-12 13:56:43'),(36,2147483647,1005,'Order# 20201205-09374814','<p>Hi my order is showing ready to ship on your tracker since Tuesday but has still not been delivered. Can you please check and let me know. </p><p><br></p><p>It is a week since I ordered - was certainly expecting delivery by now. I am holding back on my next order till this is resolved.<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-12 16:26:50','2020-12-13 00:26:50'),(37,2147483647,284,'Cancel order','Hi May I cancel order&nbsp;20201211-15260213 which I have just purchase on 11 Dec 2020 in order to add more items? Thanks.&nbsp;',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 06:18:21','2020-12-12 14:18:21'),(38,2147483647,293,'Damaged box of Estee Lauder Advanced Night Repair Eye Concentrate Matrix Serum 15ml','<p>Hello there,&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>I received my purchases last Friday. All the alcohol were nicely wrapped in bubble wrap but not the skincare products. As a result the Estee Lauder Advanced Night Repair Eye Concentrate was crushed at one side. As I bought this as a gift, is there some way you can replace the box for me? It is too ugly to give it as a gift.</p><p>Thank you very much.</p><p>Best regards,</p><p>Maria Ng 90478600<br></p>',NULL,'Solved',1,1,'2020-12-16 02:05:47','2020-12-16 02:05:47'),(39,2147483647,1219,'Confirmation of Order','<p>Hi,</p><p>My order number is&nbsp;20201211-17114238. Under My Account, the order is shown as received and pending shipping. However, I did not manage to complete the payment (no OTP sent) as the payment page did not load, and timed out. Please confirm payment of this order, and that this order is processed. If not, please advise how I can make payment again.</p><p>Thank you.</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-14 02:37:32','2020-12-14 10:37:32'),(40,2147483647,1221,'Cancel order 20201211-17364962','<p>Hi please cancel order&nbsp;20201211-17364962</p><p>I didn\'t get a confirmation that my orders went through. so i have another order with the same items (and more) in it.</p><p>please confirm<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-17 09:35:16','2020-12-17 09:35:16'),(41,2147483647,1070,'Return sunglasses','The sunglasses I ordered are way to big for my face he',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 06:33:27','2020-12-12 14:33:27'),(42,2147483647,1070,'Return sunglasses','The sunglasses I ordered are way to big for my face he',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-12 06:32:12','2020-12-12 14:32:12'),(43,2147483647,142,'Expired YSL Blanc Pur Couture','<p>Hello, I just received my items yesterday and noted that the 4 YSL Blanc Pur Couture items are expired.. the code is 40N000 (manufactured Oct 2016) for your reference.&nbsp;The packaging has also turned yellow. Seek your advice if items will be replaced or refunded.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-13 07:14:34','2020-12-13 15:14:34'),(44,2147483647,436,'Order ID: 20201201-21320996 - Missing Item','<p>Hi Support Team,</p><p>I did not receive [Jayjun Anti-Dust Therapy Mask] in this order.</p><p>Please advise.</p><p>Thanks</p><p><br></p><p>Regards,</p><p>Jenny law</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-14 06:45:22','2020-12-14 14:45:22'),(45,2147483647,949,'Urgent','<p>Hi there,</p><p><br></p><p>I’ve emailed you multiple times but there is no response. Previously, the delivery man sent the wrong parcel to me and my armani watch was swapped for a parcel with chocolates, shirt&nbsp;and a face cream.</p><p>Thankfully the delivery man swapped it back for me the next day. However, the parcel with the armani watch was obviously tampered with. the watch face plastic protector was removed and then haphazardly pasted back. also, the other person obviously tried on the watch because the strap has a mark/indent from her wearing it. and she didn’t put it back into the box properly so it was loose and falling out from the box when i received it.</p><p><br></p><p>the watch was supposed to be a christmas gift for my mom but now that someone has worn and tampered with it. i can’t gift it to her anymore. Could you&nbsp;please do something? I don’t mind an exchange or a refund. please let me know if you can help. Thank you and i hope to receive your reply soon.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>my tracking number is :&nbsp;YHAP201233700549 (armani watch)</p><p>the other party’s&nbsp;YHAP201233700548 (Hershey chocolate, lacose shirt&nbsp;and shisedo cream) Name is Karen</p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-15 13:28:22','2020-12-15 13:28:22'),(46,2147483647,949,'Urgent','<p>Hi there,</p><p><br></p><p>I’ve emailed you multiple times but there is no response. Previously, the delivery man sent the wrong parcel to me and my armani watch was swapped for a parcel with chocolates, shirt&nbsp;and a face cream.</p><p>Thankfully the delivery man swapped it back for me the next day. However, the parcel with the armani watch was obviously tampered with. the watch face plastic protector was removed and then haphazardly pasted back. also, the other person obviously tried on the watch because the strap has a mark/indent from her wearing it. and she didn’t put it back into the box properly so it was loose and falling out from the box when i received it.</p><p><br></p><p>the watch was supposed to be a christmas gift for my mom but now that someone has worn and tampered with it. i can’t gift it to her anymore. Could you&nbsp;please do something? I don’t mind an exchange or a refund. please let me know if you can help. Thank you and i hope to receive your reply soon.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>my tracking number is :&nbsp;YHAP201233700549 (armani watch)</p><p>the other party’s&nbsp;YHAP201233700548 (Hershey chocolate, lacose shirt&nbsp;and shisedo cream) Name is Karen</p>',NULL,'Solved',1,0,'2020-12-14 06:34:01','2020-12-14 14:34:01'),(47,2147483647,711,'Checking on my order status 20201129-15084328','<p>Hi there,&nbsp;</p><p>I would like to check on my order status.I have been waiting for the goods to be delivered to me for almost 1 month. May I know when can reach to me. One of the item is for Christmas present. So I hope cab get it soonest. And just to update that I have input my mobile number wrongly when placing order. But delivery address is correct. Can you help to check?&nbsp;</p><p>Appreciate to hear from you ASAP.</p><p>Thanks</p><p>Brenda<br></p>',NULL,'Solved',1,0,'2020-12-30 10:15:01','2020-12-30 10:15:01'),(48,2147483647,1066,'No update on delivery?','20201207-16553252<br><br>above is my order number. As you can see it has been ten days, and status is still \"ready for shipping\". I wonder how long it will take? As i couldnt receive after so long, i ordered from other companies and received usually within 4-5days.<br>This is the first time and if your order take so long i might never buy from your website again.',NULL,'Solved',1,1,'2020-12-30 10:16:24','2020-12-30 10:16:24'),(49,2147483647,838,'Tracking No. YHAP201234600810','<p>Hi,</p><p>Could you let me know when this order will be delivered pls?</p><p>Many thanks</p><p>Hari<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-21 03:27:00','2020-12-21 03:27:00'),(50,2147483647,274,'Expiry date','<p>Hi I recently purchase from the private sales for chocolate. When the items arrived the expiry date is 21/1/2021. It is too ridiculous that this is not stated in the item description that item having SHORT expiry date.</p><p>is it the way that the company doing business? I feel that I am cheated.<br></p>','[{\"name\":\"D2A5B5B2-CFBC-41E9-B0AC-E1602EF7CB08.jpeg\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/iFFlkwQIfrrAMJZRrCqce9X2GrRKKdNUM32BdeTK.jpeg\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-17 01:20:18','2020-12-17 01:20:18'),(51,2147483647,1085,'Order','<p><u></u>Hi</p><p>Just enquiring my order recently made.</p><p>Kind regards&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Vyas Prasad&nbsp;</p><p>vyasprasad@gmail.com</p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-17 04:36:11','2020-12-17 04:36:11'),(52,2147483647,208,'Out of Stock and Refund','<p>Hi,&nbsp;</p><p>I noticed some products of my orders have been cancelled. Can I&nbsp;know how will the refund be like ?</p><p>Also, can I also check how YSG select orders to fulfill? As far as I know, my friend and I ordered the same product, but I checked out and made payment maybe 30-40 mins earlier. But she received her purchases fully fulfilled, however the same product for mine order was cancelled.&nbsp;</p><p>Kindly advise.&nbsp;</p><p>Thank you.&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-18 01:08:30','2020-12-18 01:08:30'),(53,2147483647,360,'Delayed shipment','<p>Hi,</p><p>it seems all my products in my order have been ready to ship since the 13th December, but no updates and status just says ready to ship.</p><p><br></p><p>please can you actually ship?</p><p><br></p><p>thanks</p><p>Iain</p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-24 03:01:55','2020-12-24 03:01:55'),(54,2147483647,776,'Delivery for Order 20201213-17455349','Hi, can I check if my order no.&nbsp;20201213-17455349 will be shipping out by this week to arrive in time for Christmas?&nbsp;',NULL,'Solved',1,0,'2020-12-30 10:15:31','2020-12-30 10:15:31'),(55,2147483647,1221,'Delivery','<p>Hi,</p><p><br></p><p>Can I check when my order 20201211-18045186 will be shipped ?</p><p>It\'s been 6 days since placing the order ...</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks</p><p>Sebastien<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-18 02:15:18','2020-12-18 02:15:18'),(56,2147483647,213,'Wrong item received',NULL,NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-31 07:46:09','2020-12-31 07:46:09'),(57,2147483647,1256,'When’s the expected delivery date?','<p>hi, may I check when’s the expected delivery date or what’s happening to my order please?&nbsp;</p><p>I tracked and it seems it’s been labelled “ready to ship” since the 13th (so that’s 6 days now). The tracking number is&nbsp;YHAP201234700878.&nbsp;</p><p>Actually ordered this for a party I’m having on the 22nd; thus do let me know if there’s anything I could do to get my purchase soon?&nbsp;</p><p>thank you!&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-21 14:35:35','2020-12-21 14:35:35'),(58,2147483647,1256,'Ignore 2147483647','Hi I just received notification that my order is arriving in +/- 20mins. You may ignore the previous ticket. Thank you.',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-21 01:46:55','2020-12-21 01:46:55'),(59,2147483647,288,'Delivery','<p>Hi there,&nbsp;</p><p>My order from the 11th arrived, but my order from the 10th didn’t so far.&nbsp;</p><p>When will it be delivered?</p><p>Thank you &amp; kind regards&nbsp;</p>','[{\"name\":\"D44C2531-2B7B-4194-995A-7977ACCBE98E.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/wc81dQgaMBuXFjXohzBBnWwdWJJ1OJWaLM7JPSPs.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-22 07:42:00','2020-12-22 07:42:00'),(60,2147483647,288,'Delivery','<p>Hi there,&nbsp;</p><p>My order from the 11th arrived, but my order from the 10th didn’t so far.&nbsp;</p><p>When will it be delivered?</p><p>Thank you &amp; kind regards&nbsp;</p>','[{\"name\":\"D44C2531-2B7B-4194-995A-7977ACCBE98E.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/6pkUzXHKwXPP3GNfo40bZZAtFbD7jkc5nD5xywTt.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-22 07:41:43','2020-12-22 07:41:43'),(61,2147483647,288,'Delivery','<p>Hi there,&nbsp;</p><p>My order from the 11th arrived, but my order from the 10th didn’t so far.&nbsp;</p><p>When will it be delivered?</p><p>Thank you &amp; kind regards&nbsp;</p>','[{\"name\":\"D44C2531-2B7B-4194-995A-7977ACCBE98E.png\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/G4qtnsNa8jpbyVapvsvz77mg4AR4jJSWnKYurWVo.png\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-22 06:00:38','2020-12-22 06:00:38'),(62,2147483647,659,'ORDER 20201210-18441421','<p>Hi,</p><p>i have place my order on 10 Dec 2020 till date I still ave not receive anything.&nbsp;</p><p>Please check on your side.&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks</p><p>Celeste Lee</p><p>Hp. 91892823</p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-22 04:40:29','2020-12-22 04:40:29'),(63,2147483647,1020,'Delivery status','<p>Hi,</p><p>Please advise how long does my order take to delivery&nbsp;after payment&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-22 06:54:17','2020-12-22 06:54:17'),(64,2147483647,1061,'Order Not Delivered','<p>Placed an order two weeks ago on 10/12/20. Order status is still \"Order Placed\", and I have not received any updates on when it will be shipped out and when I will be receiving my items.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">Not only that, but many of the items were cancelled deapite the site stating that they were in stock at the time the order was placed.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">Service is very disappointing. Please inform me of the status of my order, and get it delivered to my address quickly.&nbsp;</span></p>','[{\"name\":\"Screenshot_20201224-095600_Drive.jpg\",\"path\":\"uploads\\/support_tickets\\/\\/Tum2Dm9R3KWqrR0JL3Kbnebj8JgUrK4gvugQgIcZ.jpeg\"}]','solved',1,0,'2020-12-24 03:27:48','2020-12-24 03:27:48'),(65,2147483647,659,'ORDER 20201210-18441421','<p>Hi</p><p>I have received a few of my items I m checking what about the rest???</p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2020-12-31 02:54:15','2020-12-31 02:54:15'),(66,2147483647,1061,'Received Wrong Item','<p>Ordered Lancome Abosolue Precious Cells Rose Revitalizing Lotion.</p><p>Received Lancome Absolue Precious Cells Advanced Youthful Lotion instead. This is not what I ordered. Please exchange/refund this item.<br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,0,'2021-01-11 06:47:01','2021-01-11 06:47:01'),(67,2147483647,347,'Order number 20201219-12330576','<p>Hi Dear Support.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">I have placed my order on 19th Dec and the status is not ready to ship ..&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">May I know how long it will take to ship out my order ? Ye&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.</p><p><br></p><p>Ye&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2020-12-30 08:39:10','2020-12-30 08:39:10'),(68,2147483647,779,'Return & Refund of Item Michael Kors MK2893 Watch','<p>Hi,</p><p>Just received my order today and I would like to initiate the return &amp; refund of the item- MK2893 watch in my order#20201129-20233387.&nbsp;</p><p>Reason: Item looks different from the photos</p><p>Kindly assist with this and advice on the next step. Thanks.&nbsp;</p><p>Regards,</p><p>Poh Yun</p>',NULL,'solved',1,1,'2021-01-04 06:36:31','2021-01-04 06:36:31'),(69,2147483647,347,'Order number 20201219-12330576','<p>Hi Support.</p><p>May I check where is my parcel now ? Even though I have received a email mentioned that my item has been hand over to&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">third party logistics provider on 23 Dec, you should be able to receive in the next 2-3 working days.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 0.8125rem;\">But today already 30th Dec. And I haven\'t not received anything yet.</span></p><p>Please check and advise.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you.<br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'Solved',1,1,'2020-12-31 02:04:17','2020-12-31 02:04:17'),(70,2147483647,806,'Items not here yet after 2 months','Hello, my items are not here yet. I only have one order, it has been 2 months and have been trapped in transit for more than&nbsp;1 month!&nbsp;<br>',NULL,'pending',1,1,'2021-01-25 09:02:19','2021-01-25 09:02:19'),(71,2147483647,806,'ITEMS NOT HERE YET','<p>HELLO!</p><p>the items have been MISSING for more than 2 months and the customer service has 0 replies?! Where is the parcel?!&nbsp;<br></p>',NULL,'pending',1,0,'2021-01-25 09:09:21','2021-01-25 09:09:21');
